{"parentUuid":"c353c652-76a5-45cc-bcff-ac20adb59460","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01GBQ1U6WjeWX7TAeQUihxqJ","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"c7ac18c2-cbd2-41b2-8b05-d0cf50dc66c6","timestamp":"2026-10-21T16:58:02.340Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
{"parentUuid":"c7ac18c2-cbd2-41b2-8b05-d0cf50dc66c6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFjgZwmPzxMdyptVU788","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"There's now an Appearance tab in Settings. Its first switch picks the grid/list toggle style: the current pill, or a segmented control built from the coss ui recipe. Pushed to #170 as `8efa5af`.\n\n![Settings → Appearance](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\toolbar\\settings.png)\n\n![Segmented, grid](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\toolbar\\seg-grid.png)\n\n![Segmented, list](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\toolbar\\seg-list.png)\n\n**Licensing:** the coss ui component you'd normally copy is AGPL-3.0, and pasting it in would put inkling under the AGPL. The same coss recipe also ships as MIT in their `packages/kloq`, so I built from that one. Its license is kept next to the component. The sliding highlight behind the selected option isn't in the MIT version, so I wrote that part myself.\n\n**How it's built:** the segmented control is plain React and CSS in `src/components/SegmentedControl/`; the project has no Tailwind, so I didn't add Tailwind or Base UI for one component. The options are real radio buttons, so arrow keys and screen readers work. In the dock it uses the liquid glass, and plain CSS glass where WebGPU isn't available. The selected option has a highlight that slides over in 0.2s.\n\n**How it works:** your choice is saved on this computer and survives restarts. All the options for each switch are listed in `src/lib/appearance.ts`. When you settle on one, deleting the others means removing them from that list and deleting their markup.\n\n**Next switch:** tell me which component and which look, and I'll add it.\n\nIn the Electron preview I picked Segmented in Settings and checked that the dock changed, the choice was saved, the glass drew, and clicking List switched the view. Typecheck, Biome and knip pass. No new tests."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":721,"cache_read_input_tokens":235403,"output_tokens":662,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":721,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":662,"cache_read_input_tokens":235403,"cache_creation_input_tokens":721,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":721},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgFjgZXyJSpTHQiEsBvje","requestRef":"aeed4e8e-375a-400d-a436-1052c975ecdf","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"e03bf073-142b-44e0-b5a6-22cc543e17ec","timestamp":"2026-10-21T16:58:02.340Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
