{"type":"pr-link","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","prNumber":170,"prUrl":"https://github.com/Squidys-Tools/inkling/pull/170","prRepository":"Squidys-Tools/inkling","timestamp":"2026-10-21T17:01:40.163Z"}
{"parentUuid":"0d29b6ea-3c43-4017-9565-cf3c7811b01b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFjyACjreDi4b7eiptnj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'm thinking T3's approach feels too heavy with its SPDX template downloads and overrides, so I'd prefer something lighter: a build-time generator that scans production dependencies for license fields and notice files, combined with a hand-maintained list for custom items like GradualBlur, fonts, and model assets, to produce a third-party notices output.\n\nThe file would sit alongside index.html and load only when the Settings page is opened, with no network calls. I need to check how inkling's dist is structured, scope the dependency closure to production deps (noting Electron already ships Chromium's own license notices), and decide how to handle packages missing license text -- settling on warning but still emitting rather than failing the build. Now I want to survey the actual repo to see what's there.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3604,"cache_read_input_tokens":246577,"output_tokens":790,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":601},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3604,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":790,"cache_read_input_tokens":246577,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3604,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3604},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":10885,"thinkingDisplay":"summarized","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgFjy9ngc5is5txpC3uzz","requestRef":"ac5052e8-f5bf-468b-a