{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","hash":"c2ccec265058dd37a818ba4a2d085cc130e57c32f612b4ec3f6ac1675ebd17fe","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'm deciding on a folder structure for license storage, settling on a `licenses/` directory with `notices.json` for config and individual license texts like `Apache-2.0.txt` inside it.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Writing the generator: it walks the production dependency tree, adds a short hand-kept list of vendored code and models, and outputs one JSON file."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01XijBcZwEYZAWveiALGzNad","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /c/Users/chris/.t3/worktrees/inkling/t3-47ff5304 && mkdir -p scripts/third-party-licenses && curl -sL -m 15 https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0.txt -o scripts/third-party-licenses/Apache-2.0.txt && wc -l scripts/third-party-licenses/Apache-2.0.txt && cat > scripts/third-party-licenses/notices.json <<'EOF'\n[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"bloub\",\n    \"license\": \"MIT\",\n    \"sourceUrl\": \"https://github.com/jeremy-prt/bloub\",\n    \"description\": \"The mascot's animation engine, vendored in src/components/mascot/bot.\",\n    \"noticeFile\": \"src/components/mascot/bot/LICENSE.md\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"React Bits Gradual Blur\",\n    \"license\": \"MIT + Commons Clause\",\n    \"sourceUrl\": \"https://reactbits.dev/animations/gradual-blur\",\n    \"description\": \"The blur at the library's top and bottom edges.\",\n    \"noticeFile\": \"src/components/GradualBlur/LICENSE.md\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"coss ui segmented control\",\n    \"license\": \"MIT\",\n    \"sourceUrl\": \"https://github.com/cosscom/coss/tree/main/packages/kloq\",\n    \"description\": \"The segmented control's styling.\",\n    \"noticeFile\": \"src/components/SegmentedControl/LICENSE.md\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"nomic-embed-text-v1.5\",\n    \"license\": \"Apache-2.0\",\n    \"sourceUrl\": \"https://huggingface.co/nomic-ai/nomic-embed-text-v1.5\",\n    \"description\": \"The text model behind search. Copyright Nomic AI.\",\n    \"noticeFile\": \"scripts/third-party-licenses/Apache-2.0.txt\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"nomic-embed-vision-v1.5\",\n    \"license\": \"Apache-2.0\",\n    \"sourceUrl\": \"https://huggingface.co/nomic-ai/nomic-embed-vision-v1.5\",\n    \"description\": \"The image model behind search. Copyright Nomic AI.\",\n    \"noticeFile\": \"scripts/third-party-licenses/Apache-2.0.txt\"\n  }\n]\nEOF\necho ok","description":"Add custom notices list and Apache text"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
