rceUrl}\n                      >\n                        <HugeiconsIcon icon={ArrowUpRight01Icon} size={14} />\n                      </a>\n                    )}\n                  </div>\n                  {isOpen && (\n                    <div className=\"licenses-body\">\n                      {entry.description && <p>{entry.description}</p>}\n                      {entry.noticeText ? (\n                        <pre>{entry.noticeText}</pre>\n                      ) : (\n                        <p>This package ships without a license file. Its source has the details.</p>\n                      )}\n                    </div>\n                  )}\n                </li>\n              );\n            })}\n          </ul>\n        )}\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  );\n}\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"f4cc2762-3347-4d36-be6a-aa04fe107f12","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
