{"parentUuid":"47309eb4-ef76-4745-9557-7f0d061a255e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFkXhtsiVyDU3XBVGuDG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I should flag that liquid-dom has no license and some warnings, and note its size is around 461KB unpacked or 42KB gzipped.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":226,"cache_read_input_tokens":93208,"output_tokens":730,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":36},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":226,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":730,"cache_read_input_tokens":93208,"cache_creation_input_tokens":226,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":226},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":6420,"thinkingDisplay":"summarized","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgFkXhWZHnywzfmZ9iLPX","requestRef":"b62fc642-68c2-4909-8c3d-2f6f4f4caf7c","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"7ea17712-c932-4472-82bd-5697afa332f7","timestamp":"2026-10-21T17:09:08.747Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
{"parentUuid":"7ea17712-c932-4472-82bd-5697afa332f7","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFkXhtsiVyDU3XBVGuDG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The open source licenses page is done and pushed to #170 as `18bbf3d`.\n\n![General tab](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\toolbar\\licenses-general.png)\n\n![Licenses page](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\toolbar\\licenses-list.png)\n\n**How it works (same approach as T3 Code):**\n- **At build time**, `scripts/third-party-licenses/collect.mjs` goes through every dependency the app actually ships, including Electron. It skips our own `@inkling/*` workspace packages but still includes what they pull in.\n- **Hand-listed entries**: things that aren't npm packages come from `notices.json`. That's the bloub mascot engine, the React Bits Gradual Blur, the coss segmented control, and the two Nomic models.\n- **A Vite plugin** writes the result to `third-party-licenses.json` beside `index.html`. It's 461 KB (42 KB gzipped), and the app fetches it only when you open the page, so startup isn't affected.\n- **The page**: there's a \"View licenses\" button under General. It opens a list of 194 entries that you can search by name, version or license. Each row expands to show the full license text and has a link to the source. A \"General\" link at the top takes you back.\n\n**Testing:** I ran it in the Electron preview. All 194 entries loaded, searching \"apache\" filtered to 12, and the back link returned to General. The new tests for the collector pass, and typecheck, Biome and knip are clean.\n\n**Gaps the build now warns about:**\n- **`@liquid-dom/core`** doesn't declare a license and ships no license file, so it shows as \"Unknown\". That's the library behind the liquid glass, so it's worth finding out its terms before release.\n- **No license file**: gsap, onnxruntime-node, `@tesseract.js-data/eng` and a few smaller packages don't include one. Their rows say so and link to the source.\n- **gsap** shows its own license string, \"Standard 'no charge' license\", which isn't an open source license."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":226,"cache_read_input_tokens":93208,"output_tokens":730,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":36},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":226,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":730,"cache_read_input_tokens":93208,"cache_creation_input_tokens":226,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":226},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgFkXhWZHnywzfmZ9iLPX","requestRef":"b62fc642-68c2-4909-8c3d-2f6f4f4caf7c","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"66f33794-b4de-4dad-ab73-4f6d0665328a","timestamp":"2026-10-21T17:09:08.756Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
