{"parentUuid":"2da94e80-76af-4bbd-b924-557472f96bab","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"7e4783d7-9acc-4850-82c3-bb38599eb2ff","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014mQH9ko7bDrRAdkjswieS5","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"slug\":\"base-ui\",\"name\":\"Base UI\",\"description\":\"Unstyled, accessible React components from the creators of Radix, Floating UI, and Material UI.\",\"url\":\"https://base-ui.com\",\"colListingUrl\":\"https://usecol.com/libraries/base-ui\",\"category\":\"Component Library\",\"stacks\":[\"React\",\"TypeScript\"],\"useCases\":[\"Accessibility-first\",\"Dashboards\"],\"docsUrl\":\"https://base-ui.com\",\"repoUrl\":\"https://github.com/mui/base-ui\",\"components\":[{\"id\":\"base-ui/Accordion\",\"name\":\"Accordion\",\"kind\":\"primitive\"},{\"id\":\"base-ui/Alert Dialog\",\"name\":\"Alert Dialog\",\"kind\":\"primitive\"},{\"id\":\"base-ui/Autocomplete\",\"name\":\"Autocomplete\",\"kind\":\"primitive\"},{\"id\":\"base-ui/Avatar\",\"name\":\"Avatar\",\"kind\":\"primitive\"},{\"id\":\"base-ui/Button\",\"name\":\"Button\",\"kind\":\"primitive\"},{\"id\":\"base-ui/Checkbox\",\"name\":\"Checkbox\",\"kind\":\"primitive\"},{\"id\":\"base-ui/Checkbox Group\",\"name\":\"Checkbox Group\",\"kind\":\"primitive\"},{\"id\":\"base-ui/Collapsible\",\"name\":\"Collapsible\",\"kind\":\"primitive\"},{\"id\":\"base-ui/Combobox\",\"name\":\"Combobox\",\"kind\":\"primitive\"},{\"id\":\"base-ui/Context Menu\",\"name\":\"Context Menu\",\"kind\":\"primitive\"},{\"id\":\"base-ui/Dialog\",\"name\":\"Dialog\",\"kind\":\"primitive\"},{\"id\":\"base-ui/Drawer\",\"name\":\"Drawer\",\"kind\":\"primitive\"},{\"id\":\"base-ui/Field\",\"name\":\"Field\",\"kind\":\"primitive\"},{\"id\":\"base-ui/Fieldset\",\"name\":\"Fieldset\",\"kind\":\"primitive\"},{\"id\":\"base-ui/Form\",\"name\":\"Form\",\"kind\":\"primitive\"},{\"id\":\"base-ui/Input\",\"name\":\"Input\",\"kind\":\"primitive\"},{\"id\":\"base-ui/Menu\",\"name\":\"Menu\",\"kind\":\"primitive\"},{\"id\":\"base-ui/Menubar\",\"name\":\"Menubar\",\"kind\":\"primitive\"},{\"id\":\"base-ui/Meter\",\"name\":\"Meter\",\"kind\":\"primitive\"},{\"id\":\"base-ui/Navigation Menu\",\"name\":\"Navigation Menu\",\"kind\":\"primitive\"},{\"id\":\"base-ui/Number Field\",\"name\":\"Number Field\",\"kind\":\"primitive\"},{\"id\":\"base-ui/OTP Field\",\"name\":\"OTP Field\",\"kind\":\"primitive\"},{\"id\":\"base-ui/Popover\",\"name\":\"Popover\",\"kind\":\"primitive\"},{\"id\":\"base-ui/Preview Card\",\"name\":\"Preview Card\",\"kind\":\"primitive\"},{\"id\":\"base-ui/Progress\",\"name\":\"Progress\",\"kind\":\"primitive\"},{\"id\":\"base-ui/Radio Group\",\"name\":\"Radio Group\",\"kind\":\"primitive\"},{\"id\":\"base-ui/Scroll Area\",\"name\":\"Scroll Area\",\"kind\":\"primitive\"},{\"id\":\"base-ui/Select\",\"name\":\"Select\",\"kind\":\"primitive\"},{\"id\":\"base-ui/Separator\",\"name\":\"Separator\",\"kind\":\"primitive\"},{\"id\":\"base-ui/Slider\",\"name\":\"Slider\",\"kind\":\"primitive\"},{\"id\":\"base-ui/Switch\",\"name\":\"Switch\",\"kind\":\"primitive\"},{\"id\":\"base-ui/Tabs\",\"name\":\"Tabs\",\"kind\":\"primitive\"},{\"id\":\"base-ui/Toast\",\"name\":\"Toast\",\"kind\":\"primitive\"},{\"id\":\"base-ui/Toggle\",\"name\":\"Toggle\",\"kind\":\"primitive\"},{\"id\":\"base-ui/Toggle Group\",\"name\":\"Toggle Group\",\"kind\":\"primitive\"},{\"id\":\"base-ui/Toolbar\",\"name\":\"Toolbar\",\"kind\":\"primitive\"},{\"id\":\"base-ui/Tooltip\",\"name\":\"Tooltip\",\"kind\":\"primitive\"}],\"componentCount\":37,\"gettingStarted\":[\"Read the official Base UI docs for prerequisites, installation, and current APIs. https://base-ui.com\",\"Browse the official Base UI site and choose what to use. https://base-ui.com\"],\"pricing\":{\"model\":\"free\",\"summary\":\"Base UI is free, including for commercial use, with no paid tier.\",\"license\":\"MIT\",\"source\":\"https://base-ui.com\"},\"compatibility\":{\"supported\":[],\"unsupported\":[],\"unknown\":[\"node\",\"react\",\"react-dom\"]},\"documentation\":{\"verification\":\"partial\",\"snapshots\":[{\"title\":\"base-ui install and usage\",\"url\":\"https://base-ui.com/react/overview/quick-start\",\"fetchedAt\":\"2026-10-09T20:12:29.747Z\",\"sourceRevision\":\"site-docs@2026-10-10\",\"content\":\"og Drawer Field Fieldset Form Input Menu Menubar Meter Navigation Menu Number Field OTP Field Popover Preview Card Progress Radio Group Scroll Area Select Separator Slider Switch Tabs Toast Toggle Toggle Group Toolbar Tooltip Utils CSP Provider Direction Provider mergeProps useRender GitHub npm 1.9.0 Quick start (Top) Install the library Set up Portals iOS 26+ Safari Assemble a component Pre-styled components Working with LLMs Next steps Quick start A quick guide to getting started with Base UI. View as Markdown Install the library Install Base UI using a package manager. Installation command pnpm npm yarn bun pnpm add @base-ui/react All components are included in a single package. Base UI is tree-shakable, so your app bundle will contain only the components that you actually use. Set up Portals Base UI uses portals for components that render popups, such as Dialog and Popover. To make portaled components always appear on top of the entire page, add the following style to your application layout root: layout.tsx &lt; body &gt; &lt; div className = \\\" root \\\" &gt; { children } &lt;/ div &gt; &lt;/ body &gt; styles.css .root { isolation : isolate ; } This style creates a separate stacking context for your application’s . root element. This way, popups always appear above the page contents, and any z - index property in your styles won’t interfere with them. iOS 26+ Safari Starting with iOS 26, Safari allows content beneath the UI chrome to be visible. Backdrops such as those used by dialogs must use position : absolute instead of position : fixed to cover the entire visual viewport. For this to work after the page is scrolled, the following style must be added to your global styles: styles.css body { position: relative; } Assemble a component This demo shows you how to import a Popover component, assemble its parts, and apply styles. There are examples for both Tailwind and CSS Modules below, but since Base UI is unstyled, you can use CSS-in-JS, plain CSS, or any other styling solution you prefer. Notifications index.tsx index.module.css CSS Modules StackBlitz CSS Modules StackBlitz import * as React from ' react ' ; import { Popover } from ' @base-ui/react/popover ' ; import styles from ' ./index.module.css ' ; export default function ExamplePopover () { return ( &lt;Popover.Root&gt; &lt;Popover.Trigger className={styles.Button}&gt;Notifications&lt;/Popover.Trigger&gt; &lt;Popover.Portal&gt; &lt;Popover.Positioner sideOffset={8}&gt; &lt;Popover.Popup className={styles.Popup}&gt; &lt;Popover.Arrow className={styles.Arrow} /&gt; &lt;Popover.Title className={styles.Title}&gt;Notifications&lt;/Popover.Title&gt; &lt;Popover.Description className={styles.Description}&gt; You are all caught up. Good job! &lt;/Popover.Description&gt; &lt;/Popover.Popup&gt; &lt;/Popover.Positioner&gt; &lt;/Popover.Portal&gt; &lt;/Popover.Root&gt; ); } Show code Pre-styled components shadcn/ui is a great place to start if you need pre-styled components with higher-level abstr\"}]},\"evidence\":{\"verification\":{\"page\":\"verified\",\"compatibility\":\"unknown\",\"snapshot\":\"ingested\"},\"gaps\":[\"Component coverage is partial; a missing component is not evidence of absence.\",\"No compatibility constraints have been verified for this library yet; treat every version constraint as unknown.\",\"Documentation snapshots cover only the pages listed; verify current APIs against the linked official docs.\"]}}"}]},"uuid":"64aaf867-0be3-4cae-9817-c6ec976d84f1","timestamp":"2026-10-21T17:58:56.390Z","toolUseResult":"{\"slug\":\"base-ui\",\"name\":\"Base UI\",\"description\":\"Unstyled, accessible React components from the creators of Radix, Floating UI, and Material UI.\",\"url\