{"parentUuid":"187b7cb7-d52e-4fb0-8c02-34f28ed07caa","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01Wrtzy1ykud7nMUF8YbcTYt","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"8f673125-782b-4bf2-9af5-87da82780e86","timestamp":"2026-10-21T18:19:57.179Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
{"parentUuid":"8f673125-782b-4bf2-9af5-87da82780e86","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFqvk5JyKNgn29xokhUj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I should mention the count-up feature already exists in issue #167, plus the licenses fix, and clarify where small menus fit — pointing to the Space menu in item view with concrete examples. I also need to note that node_modules was wiped and reinstalled with the electron binary installed manually, but other native postinstall steps like sharp or onnxruntime may not have run, which matters for full-app builds — and I should offer tooltips as well.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":814,"cache_read_input_tokens":183270,"output_tokens":952,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":124},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":814,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":952,"cache_read_input_tokens":183270,"cache_creation_input_tokens":814,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":814},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":8267,"thinkingDisplay":"summarized","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgFqvjf1o3avHZ23Hx6sr","requestRef":"6d6a729f-2c05-4171-82ad-622713bf41fe","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"14f817b8-45c6-4e59-aaef-23f45c431798","timestamp":"2026-10-21T18:19:57.178Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
{"parentUuid":"14f817b8-45c6-4e59-aaef-23f45c431798","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFqvk5JyKNgn29xokhUj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I added the right-click menu and pushed it to #170 as `0b0cac5`.\n\n![Right-click menu](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\toolbar\\ctxmenu-open.png)\n\n**Right-click menu.** Right-click a card, or focus it and press the menu key. You get:\n- Open\n- Read, for articles\n- Star to Top of mind or Unstar\n- Open *site* and Copy link, only when the item has a web address\n- Show in folder, in the full app only\n- Archive, which shows the usual \"Forgotten\" toast with Undo\n\nThese call the same actions as the item view's bottom bar. I built it as a small component of our own rather than adding Base UI, so your rewrite can swap it out later.\n\nI tried it in the Electron preview:\n- Arrow keys move through the list.\n- Escape closes it and puts focus back on the card.\n- Scrolling closes it.\n- Star switches to Unstar.\n- Archive removes the card and shows the toast.\n\nThe demo items have no web addresses, so the screenshot doesn't show the two link rows.\n\nI left out \"Add to Space\" for now. The Space toggle code only works on the item that's currently open, so it would need some reworking to use from the grid.\n\n**Count-up.** Yes, it's already in: #167 added React Bits CountUp to the item count above the library. It had been copied in without a credit, so the licenses page I built earlier missed it. I added a source note in `CountUp.tsx` and an entry on the licenses page.\n\n**Small menus.** One already exists: the Space picker in the item view, which opens from the folder button in the bottom bar. It's a dark rounded panel of short rows with a hover highlight, about 230px wide. The right-click menu uses the same look, so they match. Other places that could use one later:\n- a Space's rename and delete in the sidebar\n- sort or filter options\n- \"More\" on the item view's bar if it gets crowded\n\nNone of these need building now. Base UI's Menu would cover all of them in the rewrite.\n\n**node_modules was deleted.** Partway through this turn, `node_modules` disappeared from this worktree, and it wasn't anything I ran. I reinstalled from the lockfile. Install scripts didn't run, so I downloaded Electron's binary by hand. Native packages like sharp and onnxruntime may also be missing their install steps. That doesn't affect the preview, but run a fresh `bun install` before you do a `build:dir`.\n\nTooltips are still on offer whenever you want them."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":814,"cache_read_input_tokens":183270,"output_tokens":952,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":124},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":814,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":952,"cache_read_input_tokens":183270,"cache_creation_input_tokens":814,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":814},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgFqvjf1o3avHZ23Hx6sr","requestRef":"6d6a729f-2c05-4171-82ad-622713bf41fe","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"482ab0bc-0d25-4822-8699-e8f4850d3bae","timestamp":"2026-10-21T18:19:58.474Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
