{"parentUuid":"fba087ae-6d6b-449b-ab7a-aa0bad8a4161","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[{"name":"mcp__t3-code__orchestrator_capabilities","description":"List the V2 provider instances, a short list of their models from the same live catalog as the composer, inherited runtime settings, and app-owned orchestration features available to this caller. The list has the user's favorite and custom models, your own model, every current Codex, Claude, Muse and Grok model, and the first 8 current models of other providers. Other legacy models are left out. omittedModels counts models left out; pass search, such as 'sonnet 4.6', to find them. delegate_task accepts any catalog model, listed or not. For a separate top-level thread in a new or existing worktree, use t3_thread_launch with workspaceStrategy.","input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"search":{"anyOf":[{"type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]}},"additionalProperties":true},"eager_input_streaming":true,"defer_loading":true}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"b2337cb8-47a2-4533-b7c3-6cda0d7ab854","timestamp":"2026-10-21T19:25:02.163Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
