{"parentUuid":"913d61cd-3109-4987-b032-e9e87d84f08d","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01X6Lq1NscF1pvzVG1fxBWaY","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"d871304b-21d2-439a-8627-70c259fbc329","timestamp":"2026-10-21T19:30:05.762Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
{"parentUuid":"d871304b-21d2-439a-8627-70c259fbc329","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFwH9U7mdnRgBedUcV45","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I made all four changes and checked them in the Electron preview. They're pushed to #170 as `24252e5`.\n\n![Grid at rest](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\toolbar\\rest-grid.png)\n\n![List at rest](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\toolbar\\rest-list.png)\n\n- **Cards reach the blue line.** Grid and list both open with the first row at the top edge of the library frame, behind the search pill. Scrolling up brings the cards down to where they used to rest. This also works for short lists like Top of mind (3 items), which get just enough extra room to scroll. Switching Spaces or changing the search resets to the new resting position. Switching between grid and list keeps wherever you were.\n- **Gradual blur.** Its auto-hide option was already off. What made the blur disappear was a hover setting that cleared a band under the pointer, so I removed that and the blur now stays put.\n- **List thumbnails.** They were a fixed 155px tall, so any row made taller by a longer title or note left a strip below the image. Thumbnails now fill the full row height, and the gap measures 0px on every row I checked. This was the only change that got a changelog line.\n- **Sidebar tab.** It's now centred on the mascot and app name, and bigger: 32×46px, up from 26×34px. Its rounded side is now one smooth curve rather than corners, a tab shape close to your sketch. I mirrored it for the closed state and moved the small Add button over a few pixels so it isn't crowded.\n\nBecause the first row now sits under the top blur, the top edge of the cards is softened when the library first opens. That's how your mockup looked, but say if you'd rather the first row stay sharp."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":735,"cache_read_input_tokens":238622,"output_tokens":587,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":735,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":587,"cache_read_input_tokens":238622,"cache_creation_input_tokens":735,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":735},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgFwH98XeWwCrueuS7Pwp","requestRef":"959b6619-edea-47b9-92ca-1cac31240981","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"7a2d9eb2-d797-4453-a4eb-8c6f052b31f1","timestamp":"2026-10-21T19:30:05.761Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
{"parentUuid":"7a2d9eb2-d797-4453-a4eb-8c6f052b31f1","isSidechain":false,"type":"system","subtype":"stop_hook_summary","hookCount":1,"hookInfos":[{"command":"sh -c 'if ! command -v entire >/dev/null 2>&1; then exit 0; fi; exec entire hooks claude-code stop'","durationMs":12550}],"hookErrors":[],"hookAdditionalContext":[],"preventedContinuation":false,"stopReason":"","hasOutput":false,"level":"suggestion","timestamp":"2026-10-21T19:30:18.333Z","uuid":"65dd9df6-bc39-4123-81c5-1e8c0dc2d57e","toolUseID":"7277c7a1-d6f0-42e9-8a4b-1e41fb0c31b7","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
