{"parentUuid":"65dd9df6-bc39-4123-81c5-1e8c0dc2d57e","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"f7d7ab50-f167-4ae0-a78a-a910caf14c46","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"image","source":{"type":"base64","media_type":"image/png","data":""}},{"type":"text","text":"also I thought you added tooltips? many things like all the controls for spaces, and the grid/list toggle icons dont have tooltips. also find a nice filter button from col we can style so that the license page can be filtered by license. also the sidebar button is the right size but too round, I liked the rounded corners it had before, and its only a teeny tiny bit too big. also when the sidebar is closed and the button shows over the library it turns into liquid glass, I dont like that just keep it like it opqaue like always. however the tooltips do need to follow the liquid glass/css glass setting. [Image: image.png; ref=image_39f0a108-3a57-4cb3-8578-4f65ed5f237b] get rid of the open option and just leave archive and rename the star to top of mind to favorite, im thinking of something we're gonna do later. and get rid of the line break between the options too\n\n<t3_context version=\"1\">\n<context kind=\"image\" id=\"image_39f0a108-3a57-4cb3-8578-4f65ed5f237b\">\nname: image.png\nmimeType: image/png\nsizeBytes: 15909\nattachmentId: d09afd25-cdc5-42e7-866c-f30bf652d16f-a96d1f42-d225-4079-9b89-57419837b68d\n</context>\n</t3_context>\n\n[Attached image \"image.png\" is saved at: C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\userdata\\attachments\\d09afd25-cdc5-42e7-866c-f30bf652d16f-a96d1f42-d225-4079-9b89-57419837b68d.png]"}]},"uuid":"256028d5-5f9c-444a-a7f0-c4b6cf276d60","timestamp":"2026-10-21T19:34:17.967Z","imagePasteIds":[33],"permissionMode":"bypassPermissions","promptSource":"sdk","turnOrigin":"sdk","turnPosition":{"promptIndex":0,"turnIndex":168},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version