{"type":"pr-link","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","prNumber":170,"prUrl":"https://github.com/Squidys-Tools/inkling/pull/170","prRepository":"Squidys-Tools/inkling","timestamp":"2026-10-21T19:34:19.208Z"}
{"parentUuid":"d320ace4-5ea3-4e08-8803-9f1c166891ea","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFwcKtUCPLcdPdqyCJGH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I need to actually add tooltips now since I'd only offered them before. I'm thinking through building a custom tooltip component that respects whatever glass styling setting exists, then applying it broadly across controls like space settings and the grid/list toggle icons—possibly via a global tooltip system using a data attribute for wide coverage.\n\nA single global TooltipLayer component listening for pointerover/focusin events seems cleanest, finding targets via a data-tooltip attribute and showing a positioned bubble after a delay (with quick switching between adjacent tooltips). I'd need to swap native title attributes for this data attribute across the app's icon buttons, and check whether the liquid glass effect should extend to tooltips since they're portal-level elements that can appear outside the main stage.\n\nSeparately, I need to find the filter button component for the license page.\n\nThen there are several smaller fixes: making the sidebar tab less round and slightly smaller, removing the liquid glass effect from the closed tab state, and cleaning up the context menu by removing the Open option, renaming Star to Favorite/Unfavorite, and stripping out separators while keeping the rest. Let me start by locating the glass setting.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1272,"cache_read_input_tokens":239357,"output_tokens":986,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":801},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1272,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_to