{"parentUuid":"68712456-f224-43b8-8d76-e35ea5ae7abd","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFwf481eZ4ZaHdjRo8AE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'm weighing whether TooltipLayer should auto-detect native `title` attributes versus requiring an explicit `data-tooltip` attribute, leaning toward the explicit approach since auto-mutating titles feels hacky. So I'll convert existing `title=` attributes on buttons to `data-tooltip=`, and add `data-tooltip` to elements that currently only have `aria-label`, like the edge tab and close buttons.\n\nNow I'm going through specific line numbers across the file to identify which `title=` attributes to convert—card controls, update text tooltips, the space rename button, color picker, and the expanded item overlay's action bar buttons (star, move, open, archive, delete, zoom)—while leaving the PDF viewer's title prop untouched, and I still need to grep for any other components using `title=` that I might be missing.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2482,"cache_read_input_tokens":249917,"output_tokens":626,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":429},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2482,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":626,"cache_read_input_tokens":249917,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2482,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2482},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":7609,"thinkingDisplay":"summarized","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgFwf3VKbA3HTtWYG7Ntx","requestRef":"814251f6-86e8-40a8