{"parentUuid":"4174fb75-b8fc-422d-ad85-95e8b89eaac7","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFxLUNrp1s5EJRaiEGeu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The push went through with no errors, so now I should wrap up by summarizing the results along with screenshots.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":617,"cache_read_input_tokens":104930,"output_tokens":817,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":22},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":617,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":817,"cache_read_input_tokens":104930,"cache_creation_input_tokens":617,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":617},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":6734,"thinkingDisplay":"summarized","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgFxLTzJPYpmRAWNrzQBp","requestRef":"9e5108e1-10f6-4e7a-9487-acca81180087","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"ad4e4bb6-aff8-414d-9e41-71c1a5623b89","timestamp":"2026-10-21T19:43:58.500Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
{"parentUuid":"ad4e4bb6-aff8-414d-9e41-71c1a5623b89","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFxLUNrp1s5EJRaiEGeu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Everything you asked for is done, checked in the desktop preview, and pushed to #170 as `cb6d00d`.\n\n**Tooltips.** You were right: I hadn't actually added them. They're there now, appearing after a short pause on hover, or right away when a control is reached with the keyboard.\n- They cover the Space controls (color, move up/down, rename, delete), the grid/list icons, the sidebar tab, Add, Settings, clear search, and the buttons in the item view and reader.\n- Tooltips on the floating toolbar and the grid/list dock use liquid glass. Everywhere else they use the CSS glass, because liquid glass draws the wrong background over the sidebar and the item view.\n\n![Grid/list tooltip](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\tooltips\\dock.png)\n![Space control tooltip](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\tooltips\\space.png)\n\n**Sidebar button.** It's back to the 14px corners and a touch smaller (30×44). It stays opaque when the sidebar is closed.\n\n![Closed sidebar tab](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\tooltips\\tab-closed.png)\n\n**Right-click menu.** Open is gone, \"Star\" is now \"Favorite\", and there are no divider lines. The other options still appear when they apply: Read for articles, Open link and Copy link for web links, and Show in folder in the desktop app.\n\n![Card menu](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\tooltips\\ctxmenu.png)\n\n**License filter.** Col doesn't list a filter component, so I rebuilt the one from shadcn/ui's data table example (MIT) in our own CSS.\n- It's a dashed \"License\" button that opens a checklist of licenses, most common first, each with its count.\n- The licenses you pick show as small badges in the button, and the count changes to \"42 of 196 notices\".\n- It combines with the search box, and \"Clear filter\" resets it. I left out the divider line above \"Clear filter\" to match the card menu.\n\n![License filter](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\tooltips\\filter-picked.png)\n\nThe changelog is updated for the menu, tooltips and filter. I didn't touch #174."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":617,"cache_read_input_tokens":104930,"output_tokens":817,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":22},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":617,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":817,"cache_read_input_tokens":104930,"cache_creation_input_tokens":617,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":617},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgFxLTzJPYpmRAWNrzQBp","requestRef":"9e5108e1-10f6-4e7a-9487-acca81180087","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"204c3c15-9605-4931-8b42-42f1c44fb431","timestamp":"2026-10-21T19:43:58.793Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
