{"parentUuid":"f178d5d2-388f-4d07-80c9-e2633713774b","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"fecd25ef-3a39-4b84-8576-5e7ad975e900","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"image","source":{"type":"base64","media_type":"image/png","data":""}},{"type":"image","source":{"type":"base64","media_type":"image/png","data":""}},{"type":"text","text":"I also just noticed you employed a workaround for the item detail view. [Image: image.png; ref=image_b4a916ee-94fd-4904-a36d-abc58b3efa2d] it causes many things of the ui to break, and does not work well because it fakes going into a complete new ui screen instead of actually doing that [Image: image.png; ref=image_ee674335-d1aa-49ec-bd68-575c22353c70]\n\n<t3_context version=\"1\">\n<context kind=\"image\" id=\"image_b4a916ee-94fd-4904-a36d-abc58b3efa2d\">\nname: image.png\nmimeType: image/png\nsizeBytes: 415066\nattachmentId: d09afd25-cdc5-42e7-866c-f30bf652d16f-32a019cc-b254-48e0-a3ef-6fdc1310499c\n</context>\n<context kind=\"image\" id=\"image_ee674335-d1aa-49ec-bd68-575c22353c70\">\nname: image.png\nmimeType: image/png\nsizeBytes: 413858\nattachmentId: d09afd25-cdc5-42e7-866c-f30bf652d16f-79cead48-f128-4e3a-9b95-ae1cb714caf4\n</context>\n</t3_context>\n\n[Attached image \"image.png\" is saved at: C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\userdata\\attachments\\d09afd25-cdc5-42e7-866c-f30bf652d16f-32a019cc-b254-48e0-a3ef-6fdc1310499c.png]\n\n[Attached image \"image.png\" is saved at: C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\userdata\\attachments\\d09afd25-cdc5-42e7-866c-f30bf652d16f-79cead48-f128-4e3a-9b95-ae1cb714caf4.png]"}]},"uuid":"c31726f3-fb1d-48fe-b2e2-40cdabf11db7","timestamp":"2026-10-21T19:44:09.669Z","imagePasteIds":[34,35],"permissionMode":"bypassPermissions","promptSource":"sdk","turnOrigin":"sdk","turnPosition":{"promptIndex":0,"turnIndex":169},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"feat/g