{"parentUuid":"19e69798-c75b-4002-9a1c-32b8c36ae236","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_018UGjh3CJ5ttXx3RU9rjg3x","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"ce8137d5-8d5c-47bd-aa91-5efd202bb76e","timestamp":"2026-10-21T19:46:27.814Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
{"parentUuid":"ce8137d5-8d5c-47bd-aa91-5efd202bb76e","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFxWJgyb4XHbKypu97bM","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'm figuring out how the overlay should animate from the card's position into its final docked position, filling the stage during flight and then settling into a bordered panel with rounded corners. I'm also considering how frameRect should measure the main element's padding box, accounting for scrollbar exclusion since it's overflow hidden.\n\nSince the overlay renders outside main, I need separate CSS variables defined on the overlay itself, calculating top inset from titlebar height, with different left offsets depending on whether the sidebar is open or closed on desktop (to clear the edge tab), while that rule only applies above the mobile breakpoint where the tab is hidden. I'm checking whether the overlay layer is a sibling of the sidebar so it can react to the sidebar's open state via a CSS selector, and confirming the inset transition handles the sidebar toggle smoothly.\n\nNow I'm working out how the inspector panel should align to the stage's top and bottom insets so the header clears the titlebar band and the footer action row's bottom edge lines up with the stage bottom, adjusting padding values accordingly.\n\nI still need to verify the titlebar-height variable is defined for web preview, check mobile media query overrides for item-stage and item-inspector, and figure out which elements get marked inert while an item panel is open.\n\nChecking where main closes relative to the settings overlay matters — if settings renders outside main, applying inert to all of main while an item is selected would work cleanly. The clip-path on library-scroll using scroll-reach-top/bottom variables likely exists to hide cards sliding beneath the toolbar band during the opening animation, even though the full overlay covers the view once settled.\n\nI'm also tracing z-index stacking: the overlay sits at z-6 in app-shell, and since main has no z-index of its own, its children inherit app-shell's stacking context directly — so if edge-blur or view-dock have z-indexes above 6, they'd incorrectly render above the overlay, which is probably why edge-blur gets hidden via visibility when an item is open.\n\nI'll check capture bar's z-index similarly, and note the selected card's focus ring gets covered now too. With main set inert, aria-modal={false} on the dialog should be fine.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5903,"cache_read_input_tokens":128140,"output_tokens":2153,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1911},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5903,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":2153,"cache_read_input_tokens":128140,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5903,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5903},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":22431,"thinkingDisplay":"summarized","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgFxWJHRsUkBkFfgN3dqj","requestRef":"beceb798-56a0-4222-9920-7993709754c5","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"f98fdbfe-2479-48ca-b01c-5a52c8973d9d","timestamp":"2026-10-21T19:46:27.813Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
