{"parentUuid":"003dc954-33a9-4a65-9ee8-161deb10f967","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_record","entries":[],"toolInputCopies":[{"id":"toolu_01BqGtadX89f5sUtMfPoL8J6","copy":"wire"}]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"bca64d5b-957f-47fc-a17f-20b4cf4dc992","timestamp":"2026-10-21T19:47:55.266Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
{"parentUuid":"bca64d5b-957f-47fc-a17f-20b4cf4dc992","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFxdsYcA1irZAaHDTYxC","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'm working through React's timing here—unmount cleanup happens in the commit phase, but since this uses useEffect, the passive cleanup for unmounted components runs after the mutation phase, meaning the inert attribute would already be removed by then.\n\nI'll add inert to main conditionally based on whether an item is selected, using React 19's boolean inert support. I need to check edge cases: global keydown listeners still fire even when main is inert since inert only blocks focus and clicks, not event propagation, and search input lives inside the capture bar which is already covered. The has-open-item class seems unused elsewhere now that I've removed its CSS rules, so I can just replace it with the inert attribute in App.tsx.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":615,"cache_read_input_tokens":146931,"output_tokens":922,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":425},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":615,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":922,"cache_read_input_tokens":146931,"cache_creation_input_tokens":615,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":615},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":7503,"thinkingDisplay":"summarized","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgFxdsEGJbPJkXnxEu8kL","requestRef":"84902763-19ad-4e83-8eb0-a51f9df960af","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"6