{"parentUuid":"f6ad2024-905a-4d06-9d78-13b13f560242","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"c55a8f68-b387-4fca-899b-44af583787ae","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"image","source":{"type":"base64","media_type":"image/jpeg","data":""}},{"type":"image","source":{"type":"base64","media_type":"image/png","data":""}},{"type":"text","text":"get rid of that add button there [Image: image.png; ref=image_48a67dac-2fb0-47aa-a188-8b606ebf1f20] . I also want to recreate the add menu with something similar to the vioraui create new disclosure button, although it has some bugs so recreate it, style it for our app, add the license just to be nice\n\nalso this is genuinely just too much whitespace fix it [Image: image.png; ref=image_ac191b4c-a23a-48d1-ac56-ead5295423b8]\n\n<t3_context version=\"1\">\n<context kind=\"image\" id=\"image_48a67dac-2fb0-47aa-a188-8b606ebf1f20\">\nname: image.png\nmimeType: image/png\nsizeBytes: 956285\nattachmentId: d09afd25-cdc5-42e7-866c-f30bf652d16f-ac176784-9813-44e7-93c2-b2433b1ae6ad\n</context>\n<context kind=\"image\" id=\"image_ac191b4c-a23a-48d1-ac56-ead5295423b8\">\nname: image.png\nmimeType: image/png\nsizeBytes: 392650\nattachmentId: d09afd25-cdc5-42e7-866c-f30bf652d16f-d97ecba9-9938-497f-a8d0-096b8596216c\n</context>\n</t3_context>\n\n[Attached image \"image.png\" is saved at: C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\userdata\\attachments\\d09afd25-cdc5-42e7-866c-f30bf652d16f-ac176784-9813-44e7-93c2-b2433b1ae6ad.png]\n\n[Attached image \"image.png\" is saved at: C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\userdata\\attachments\\d09afd25-cdc5-42e7-866c-f30bf652d16f-d97ecba9-9938-497f-a8d0-096b8596216c.png]"}]},"uuid":"b47fcfe1-fe04-4b58-84e7-f86fcf6ca7b6","timestamp":"2026-10-21T20:47:16.623Z","imagePasteIds":[36,37],"permissionMode":"bypassPermissions","promptSource":"sdk","turnOrigin":"sdk","turnPosition":{"promptIndex":0,"turnIndex":170},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad