{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","hash":"4dffb6f7be0e212e376dab8a718a99a46dfd9778e80ed799ffd810ed2b0f3439","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I should check whether the Space create form uses the same capture-editor-actions class, since earlier I only found it on the App modal. I'll clean up the CSS by removing rule blocks whose selectors are solely the target ones, trimming just the relevant selector line from the multi-selector block around 2854, and deleting the media query block spanning 2912-2927 entirely.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"I'll remove those rules with a small parser that drops whole rule blocks (and one selector from the shared `:active` list) rather than line-deleting:"},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01LwBTc9iKYjZmoHTeibJhZz","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /c/Users/chris/.t3/worktrees/inkling/t3-47ff5304 && python - <<'EOF'\nimport io,re\np='src/App.css'\ns=io.open(p,encoding='utf-8',newline='').read()\ndead=re.compile(r'capture-modal|capture-option|capture-editor|file-picker|quote-capture|add-button\\.is-compact')\n# remove the whole mobile media block for the modal\na='''@media (max-width: 780px) {\n  .capture-modal-backdrop {'''\ni=s.index(a); j=s.index('\\n}\\n',i)+3\ns=s[:i]+s[j:]\ns=s.replace('.capture-option:active:not(:disabled),\\n','',1)\nout=[];pos=0\n# top-level rules only: walk blocks at depth 0\ndepth=0;start=0;i=0;blocks=[]\nwhile i<len(s):\n    c=s[i]\n    if s.startswith('/*',i):\n        i=s.index('*/',i)+2;continue\n    if c=='{':\n        if depth==0: sel_start=start\n        depth+=1\n    elif c=='}':\n        depth-=1\n        if depth==0:\n            blocks.append((sel_start,i+1)); start=i+1\n    elif depth==0 and c in ';': start=i+1\n    i+=1\nremoved=0\nfor a,b in reversed(blocks):\n    seg=s[a:b]\n    sel=seg[:seg.index('{')]\n    # strip leading comments/whitespace from selector\n    sel_clean=re.sub(r'/\\*.*?\\*/','',sel,flags=re.S).strip()\n    if sel_clean.startswith('@'): continue\n    parts=[x.strip() for x in sel_clean.split(',')]\n    if parts and all(dead.search(x) for x in parts):\n        # keep any comment before? drop comment only if directly attached -- keep simple: remove selector+block, keep leading comments\n        lead=sel[:len(sel)-len(sel.lstrip())]\n        m=re.match(r'(\\s*(?:/\\*.*?\\*/\\s*)*)',sel,re.S)\n        s=s[:a+len(m.group(1))]+s[b:].lstrip('\\n')+'' if False else s[:a+len(m.group(1))]+s[b:]\n        removed+=1\ns=re.sub(r'\\n{3,}','\\n\\n',s)\nio.open(p,'w',encoding='utf-8',newline='').write(s)\nprint('removed',removed)\nEOF\ngrep -n \"capture-modal\\|capture-option\\|capture-editor\\|file-picker\\|quote-capture\\|is-compact\" src/App.css; git diff --stat src/App.css; bunx biome check --write src/App.css 2>&1 | tail -2"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
