{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","hash":"4455d7e0f6808488c1056b8b54dabe593eb49b2bb19752f4a1bc1c5deda3ed9a","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Viora's design uses a light collapsed button expanding into a light outer panel with a white inner card, but that approach doesn't translate well to our dark theme. I'm adapting it by using a dark raised surface for the outer panel and our darker frame color with a border for the inner card, keeping the same nested structure but inverted for dark mode.\n\nFor the smaller details I'm matching header labels to our muted text, giving the close button a round muted background with a light X, and styling tiles with muted icons that lighten on hover against a subtle active background. The save button stays cream like our Add button for visual continuity, while form inputs inside the card get a slightly lighter surface background with a border to stand out from the frame.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_019AZ6epeLY87T98Xf6nNPnb","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304\\src\\components\\AddMenu\\AddMenu.css","content":"/* Holds the Add button's place in the sidebar footer while the menu, anchored\n   to its bottom edge, grows up over the Spaces list. */\n.add-menu {\n  position: relative;\n  height: 40px;\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n}\n.add-menu .add-button {\n  width: 100%;\n  margin: 0;\n}\n.add-menu-panel {\n  position: absolute;\n  right: 0;\n  bottom: 0;\n  left: 0;\n  z-index: 20;\n  padding: 4px;\n  border: 1px solid var(--library-border);\n  background: var(--library-surface-raised);\n  box-shadow: 0 18px 44px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);\n}\n.add-menu-header {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n  height: 40px;\n  padding: 0 8px 0 12px;\n}\n.add-menu-header:has(.add-menu-round + .add-menu-title) {\n  padding-left: 8px;\n}\n.add-menu-title {\n  flex: 1 1 auto;\n  color: var(--library-text-soft);\n  font: 600 14px / 18px var(--font-ui);\n}\n.add-menu-round {\n  flex: 0 0 auto;\n  width: 22px;\n  height: 22px;\n  display: grid;\n  place-items: center;\n  padding: 0;\n  border: 0;\n  border-radius: 999px;\n  background: #34302c;\n  color: var(--library-text);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background 0.18s ease;\n}\n.add-menu-round:hover {\n  background: #45403a;\n}\n.add-menu-body {\n  padding: 6px;\n  border: 1px solid var(--library-border);\n  border-radius: 14px;\n  background: var(--library-frame);\n}\n.add-menu-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));\n  gap: 2px;\n}\n.add-menu-tile {\n  min-width: 0;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 6px;\n  padding: 12px 2px 10px;\n  border: 0;\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  background: transparent;\n  color: var(--library-muted);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition:\n    background 0.18s ease,\n    color 0.18s ease;\n}\n.add-menu-tile span {\n  max-width: 100%;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  color: var(--library-text-soft);\n  font: 500 12px / 15px var(--font-ui);\n  text-overflow: ellipsis;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n.add-menu-tile:hover:not(:disabled),\n.add-menu-tile:focus-visible {\n  outline: 0;\n  background: var(--glass-active);\n  color: var(--library-text);\n}\n.add-menu-tile:disabled {\n  cursor: wait;\n  opacity: 0.5;\n}\n.add-menu-form {\n  display: grid;\n  gap: 6px;\n}\n.add-menu-form input,\n.add-menu-form textarea {\n  width: 100%;\n  min-width: 0;\n  padding: 9px 10px;\n  border: 1px solid var(--library-border);\n  border-radius: 9px;\n  outline: 0;\n  background: var(--library-surface);\n  color: var(--library-text);\n  font: 13px / 18px var(--font-ui);\n  transition: border-color 0.18s ease;\n}\n.add-menu-form textarea {\n  min-height: 72px;\n  max-height: 160px;\n  resize: vertical;\n}\n.add-menu-form :is(input, textarea):focus {\n  border-color: #4a443d;\n}\n.add-menu-form :is(input, textarea)::placeholder {\n  color: #5e5850;\n}\n.add-menu-save {\n  height: 34px;\n  margin-top: 2px;\n  border: 0;\n  border-radius: 9px;\n  background: var(--library-text);\n  color: var(--library-canvas);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  font: 600 13px / 16px var(--font-ui);\n  transition: background 0.18s ease;\n}\n.add-menu-save:hover:not(:disabled) {\n  background: #f2ece1;\n}\n.add-menu-save:disabled {\n  cursor: wait;\n  opacity: 0.65;\n}\n.add-menu-error {\n  margin: 6px 4px 2px;\n  color: #e08a6a;\n  font: 12px / 16px var(--font-ui);\n}\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0178nXkCkm6MuVQVH7fb3oc9","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /c/Users/chris/.t3/worktrees/inkling/t3-47ff5304 && python - <<'EOF'\nimport io\np='src/App.css'\ns=io.open(p,encoding='utf-8',newline='').read()\na='''.add-button:active:not(:disabled) {\n  transform: scale(0.96);\n}'''\nassert s.count(a)==1\n# `scale` rather than transform: the menu's layout animation owns transform.\ns=s.replace(a,'''/* scale, not transform: the Add menu's open animation owns transform. */\n.add-button:active:not(:disabled) {\n  scale: 0.96;\n}''')\na='''  transition:\n    background 0.18s ease,\n    transform 0.18s ease;\n}\n'''\ni=s.index('.add-button {')\nj=s.index(a,i)\ns=s[:j]+'''  transition:\n    background 0.18s ease,\n    scale 0.18s ease;\n}\n'''+s[j+len(a):]\nio.open(p,'w',encoding='utf-8',newline='').write(s)\nEOF\nsed -n '/^\\.add-button {/,/^}/p' src/App.css"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
