u-tile\");\n      await cdp.evaluate(clickCaptureOption, \"Note\");\n      await waitFor(\"note input\", hasSelector, 'textarea[aria-label=\"New note\"]');\n      await cdp.evaluate(setInputValue, 'textarea[aria-label=\"New note\"]', noteText);''')\nio.open(p,'w',encoding='utf-8',newline='').write(s)\n\np='.claude/skills/verify-inkling/features/capture-note.md'\ns=io.open(p,encoding='utf-8',newline='').read()\nr('''- Note tile in the Add to your library dialog.''','''- Note tile in the Add menu.''')\nr('''Click Add in the top bar. The dialog offers Note, Link, File, Quote, and Screenshot. Choose Note, type a line, and press Save to library. The new card lands at the top of Everything.''','''Click Add at the foot of the sidebar. It opens into a menu of Note, Link, Quote, File, and Screenshot. Choose Note, type a line, and press Enter or Save to library. The new card lands at the top of Everything.''')\nr('''  {\"label\": \"open Add\", \"click\": \"button[title='Add something to your library']\"},\n  {\"label\": \"choose Note\", \"clickText\": {\"selector\": \"button\", \"text\": \"Write something to remember\"}},\n  {\"label\": \"note field\", \"wait\": \"input[aria-label='New note']\"},\n  {\"label\": \"type note\", \"fill\": \"input[aria-label='New note']\", \"text\": \"verify-inkling probe note\"},\n  {\"label\": \"save\", \"click\": \"button.capture-save[type='submit']\"},''','''  {\"label\": \"open Add\", \"click\": \"button[data-tooltip='Add something to your library']\"},\n  {\"label\": \"choose Note\", \"clickText\": {\"selector\": \".add-menu-tile\", \"text\": \"Note\"}},\n  {\"label\": \"note field\", \"wait\": \"textarea[aria-label='New note']\"},\n  {\"label\": \"type note\", \"fill\": \"textarea[aria-label='New note']\", \"text\": \"verify-inkling probe note\"},\n  {\"label\": \"save\", \"click\": \"button.add-menu-save\"},''')\nr('''- The dialog only appears on Add. The Add button has a title, not visible text.''','''- The menu only appears on Add, which lives in the sidebar; opening Add from elsewhere (the N shortcut, an empty library) opens the sidebar too.''')\nio.open(p,'w',encoding='utf-8',newline='').write(s)\np='.claude/skills/verify-inkling/features/spaces.md'\ns=io.open(p,encoding='utf-8',newline='').read()\nr(\"button[title='Delete Space']\",\"button[data-tooltip='Delete Space']\")\nio.open(p,'w',encoding='utf-8',newline='').write(s)\nEOF\ngrep -n \"fill\\b\\|\\\"fill\\\"\" .claude/skills/verify-inkling/scripts/drive.mjs 2>/dev/null | head -5; ls .claude/skills/verify-inkling/"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
