w card lands at the top of Everything.","-","-## Driving it with `scripts/drive.mjs`","-","-Save as `steps.json`, then run with a fresh evidence dir:","-","-```json","-[","-  {\"label\": \"open Add\", \"click\": \"button[title='Add something to your library']\"},","-  {\"label\": \"choose Note\", \"clickText\": {\"selector\": \"button\", \"text\": \"Write something to remember\"}},","-  {\"label\": \"note field\", \"wait\": \"input[aria-label='New note']\"},","-  {\"label\": \"type note\", \"fill\": \"input[aria-label='New note']\", \"text\": \"verify-inkling probe note\"},","-  {\"label\": \"save\", \"click\": \"button.capture-save[type='submit']\"},","-  {\"label\": \"card shows\", \"expect\": \"[...document.querySelectorAll('article')].some(a => a.textContent.includes('verify-inkling probe note'))\", \"timeoutMs\": 10000},","-  {\"label\": \"shot\", \"shot\": \"note-saved.png\"}","-]","-```","-","-End state proof: the card with the text is in the grid, and `items` has one row with `kind = 'note'`, `body = 'verify-inkling probe note'`, `body_format = 'md'`, `archived = 0`. The title stays null for notes.","-","-## Gotchas","-","-- Note title is null; the text lives in `body`. Check `body`, not `title`.","-- The dialog only appears on Add. The Add button has a title, not visible text.","-- Link, File, Quote, and Screenshot are not driven by this map yet.","+# Capture a note from the Add menu\r","+\r","+## Sub-features\r","+\r","+- Note tile in the Add menu.\r","+- Save to library button; the card appears before any processing finishes.\r","+\r","+## How to get to it (user POV)\r","+\r","+Click Add at the foot of the sidebar. It opens into a menu of Note, Link, Quote, File, and Screenshot. Choose Note, type a line, and press Enter or Save to library. The new card lands at the top of Everything.\r","+\r","+## Driving it with `scripts/drive.mjs`\r","+\r","+Save as `steps.json`, then run with a fresh evidence dir:\r","+\r","+```json\r","+[\r","+  {\"label\": \"open Add\", \"click\": \"button[data-tooltip='Add something to your library']\"},\r","+  {\"label\": \"choose Note\", \"clickText\": {\"selector\": \".add-menu-tile\", \"text\": \"Note\"}},\r","+  {\"label\": \"note field\", \"wait\": \"textarea[aria-label='New note']\"},\r","+  {\"label\": \"type note\", \"fill\": \"textarea[aria-label='New note']\", \"text\": \"verify-inkling probe note\"},\r","+  {\"label\": \"save\", \"click\": \"button.add-menu-save\"},\r","+  {\"label\": \"card shows\", \"expect\": \"[...document.querySelectorAll('article')].some(a => a.textContent.includes('verify-inkling probe note'))\", \"timeoutMs\": 10000},\r","+  {\"label\": \"shot\", \"shot\": \"note-saved.png\"}\r","+]\r","+```\r","+\r","+End state proof: the card with the text is in the grid, and `items` has one row with `kind = 'note'`, `body = 'verify-inkling probe note'`, `body_format = 'md'`, `archived = 0`. The title stays null for notes.\r","+\r","+## Gotchas\r","+\r","+- Note title is null; the text lives in `body`. Check `body`, not `title`.\r","+- The menu only appears on Add, which lives in the sidebar. Opening Add another way (the N shortcut) opens the sidebar too.\r","+- Link, File, Quote, and Screenshot are not driven by this map yet.\r"]}]},{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304\\.claude\\skills\\verify-inkling\\features\\spaces.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":17,"newStart":1,"newLines":17,"lines":["-# Spaces","-","-## Sub-features","-","-- Add a Space, rename it, delete it. Items are kept when a Space is deleted.","-","-## How to get to it (user POV)","-","-Click the plus beside SPACES in the sidebar to add one. Name it in the Space name field. Rename and delete live on the Space row.","-","-## Driving it with `scripts/drive.mjs`","-","-Mapped but not yet driven. Start with `button[aria-label='Add a Space']`, then `input[aria-label='Space name']` with `fill`, then `button[title='Delete Space']`. End state: the Space row exists in the sidebar, and its items are still in `items`.","-","-## Gotchas","-","-- Not yet proven on a Linux run. The Space name field may need an explicit Enter key; verify when driven.","+# Spaces\r","+\r","+## Sub-features\r","+\r","+- Add a Space, rename it, delete it. Items are kept when a Space is deleted.\r","+\r","+## How to get to it (user POV)\r","+\r","+Click the plus beside SPACES in the sidebar to add one. Name it in the Space name field. Rename and delete live on the Space row.\r","+\r","+## Driving it with `scripts/drive.mjs`\r","+\r","+Mapped but not yet driven. Start with `button[aria-label='Add a Space']`, then `input[aria-label='Space name']` with `fill`, then `button[data-tooltip='Delete Space']`. End state: the Space row exists in the sidebar, and its items are still in `items`.\r","+\r","+## Gotchas\r","+\r","+- Not yet proven on a Linux run. The Space name field may need an explicit Enter key; verify when driven."]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304\\.claude\\skills\\verify-inkling\\features\\capture-note.md","C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304\\.claude\\skills\\verify-inkling\\features\\spaces.md"]}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"b5f56eec-88ae-4d60-a8c9-949086363578","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
