{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","hash":"0eab4b9199689e5e37ccc91523b345f30078ffb2b4f71f838536866d13654f2e","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'm checking that the ui-smoke file did get written before the markdown assertions failed — it did, so the issue must be CRLF line endings in the markdown I need to normalize.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"The smoke script is updated. The skill doc likely has CRLF line endings, so I'll retry it newline-agnostically:"},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01E3SiVR7LMQaXJoHa3AxL3q","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /c/Users/chris/.t3/worktrees/inkling/t3-47ff5304 && file .claude/skills/verify-inkling/features/capture-note.md .claude/skills/verify-inkling/features/spaces.md; python - <<'EOF'\nimport io\ndef edit(p, pairs):\n    raw=io.open(p,encoding='utf-8',newline='').read()\n    crlf='\\r\\n' in raw\n    s=raw.replace('\\r\\n','\\n')\n    for a,b in pairs:\n        assert s.count(a)==1,(p,a[:60])\n        s=s.replace(a,b)\n    if crlf: s=s.replace('\\n','\\r\\n')\n    io.open(p,'w',encoding='utf-8',newline='').write(s)\nedit('.claude/skills/verify-inkling/features/capture-note.md',[\n('''- Note tile in the Add to your library dialog.''','''- Note tile in the Add menu.'''),\n('''Click Add in the top bar. The dialog offers Note, Link, File, Quote, and Screenshot. Choose Note, type a line, and press Save to library. The new card lands at the top of Everything.''','''Click Add at the foot of the sidebar. It opens into a menu of Note, Link, Quote, File, and Screenshot. Choose Note, type a line, and press Enter or Save to library. The new card lands at the top of Everything.'''),\n('''  {\"label\": \"open Add\", \"click\": \"button[title='Add something to your library']\"},\n  {\"label\": \"choose Note\", \"clickText\": {\"selector\": \"button\", \"text\": \"Write something to remember\"}},\n  {\"label\": \"note field\", \"wait\": \"input[aria-label='New note']\"},\n  {\"label\": \"type note\", \"fill\": \"input[aria-label='New note']\", \"text\": \"verify-inkling probe note\"},\n  {\"label\": \"save\", \"click\": \"button.capture-save[type='submit']\"},''','''  {\"label\": \"open Add\", \"click\": \"button[data-tooltip='Add something to your library']\"},\n  {\"label\": \"choose Note\", \"clickText\": {\"selector\": \".add-menu-tile\", \"text\": \"Note\"}},\n  {\"label\": \"note field\", \"wait\": \"textarea[aria-label='New note']\"},\n  {\"label\": \"type note\", \"fill\": \"textarea[aria-label='New note']\", \"text\": \"verify-inkling probe note\"},\n  {\"label\": \"save\", \"click\": \"button.add-menu-save\"},'''),\n('''- The dialog only appears on Add. The Add button has a title, not visible text.''','''- The menu only appears on Add, which lives in the sidebar. Opening Add another way (the N shortcut) opens the sidebar too.'''),\n])\nedit('.claude/skills/verify-inkling/features/spaces.md',[(\"button[title='Delete Space']\",\"button[data-tooltip='Delete Space']\")])\nEOF\ngit diff --stat -- .claude scripts/ui-smoke.mjs"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
