{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","hash":"79dc871ee6e61a9ef850accc36646fa328f4b1dfc9e94924be1d8fcd66ca6a17","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'm reorganizing the CSS comments so the image-height note sits with the correct rule, simplifying the list-mode card-image styling for clarity.\n\nI also want to check the card-content children for flex issues—like line-clamped headings using -webkit-box—to make sure stretching behaves correctly, and verify visually with a screenshot.\n\n","signature":""},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01LKSAWmjY33Ginz4zMeECQk","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /c/Users/chris/.t3/worktrees/inkling/t3-47ff5304 && python - <<'EOF'\nimport io\np='src/App.css'\ns=io.open(p,encoding='utf-8',newline='').read()\na='''/* The image covers its cell instead of sizing the row, so a tall photo cannot\n   stretch the row; the text sets the height and the footer keeps to the bottom. */\n.list-mode .card-image-wrap {\n  min-height: 120px;\n}\n.list-mode .card-image-wrap > .card-image {'''\nassert s.count(a)==1\ns=s.replace(a,'''.list-mode .card-image-wrap {\n  min-height: 120px;\n}\n/* The image covers its cell instead of sizing the row, so a tall photo cannot\n   stretch the row; the text sets the height. */\n.list-mode .card-image-wrap > .card-image {''')\nio.open(p,'w',encoding='utf-8',newline='').write(s)\nEOF\nbunx biome check --write src/App.css 2>&1 | tail -1; bunx vite build --mode electron-preview 2>&1 | grep -i \"error\\|built\"; S=$(cat /tmp/ink-scratch); kill $(cat $S/pid); sleep 1; rm -rf $S/ud; (unset ELECTRON_RUN_AS_NODE; node_modules/electron/dist/electron.exe . --preview --user-data-dir=\"$(cygpath -w $S/ud)\" --remote-debugging-port=0 > $S/out.log 2>&1 & echo $! > $S/pid); for i in $(seq 30); do [ -f $S/ud/DevToolsActivePort ] && break; sleep 0.5; done; sleep 3; P=$(head -1 $S/ud/DevToolsActivePort); cd /c/Users/chris/AppData/Local/Temp/agents/liquid-glass-run && mkdir -p ../chat-images/addmenu && sed -i 's#chat-images/toolbar/#chat-images/addmenu/#' ev.ts && bun ev.ts $P '(async()=>{document.querySelector(\"[data-tooltip=\\\"List view\\\"]\").click(); await new Promise(r=>setTimeout(r,1200)); return [...document.querySelectorAll(\".library-card\")].slice(0,8).map(c=>Math.round(c.getBoundingClientRect().height))})()' list-after"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
