{"parentUuid":"41ddf7ef-ddf0-4282-a734-abb56f5aa307","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"d217de97-c69e-4ffb-8cab-90ef6199535a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017KaLWuHFbNAF56XdJndQPf","type":"tool_result","content":"- Adjust chunk size limit for this warning via build.chunkSizeWarningLimit.\u001b[39m\n\u001b[32m✓ built in 2.52s\u001b[39m\nconst list = await (await fetch(`http://127.0.0.1:${process.argv[2]}/json/list`)).json();\nconst ws = new WebSocket(list.find((t: any) => t.type === \"page\" && t.url.startsWith(\"app://\")).webSocketDebuggerUrl);\nawait new Promise((r) => ws.addEventListener(\"open\", r, { once: true }));\nws.send(JSON.stringify({ id: 1, method: \"Page.reload\", params: { ignoreCache: true } })); await Bun.sleep(3000); ws.close();\n[This command modified 1 file you've previously read: src\\components\\AddMenu\\AddMenu.tsx. Call Read before editing.]","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"9a95de18-77c3-41ed-a718-34b8d7830cf1","timestamp":"2026-10-21T21:41:15.818Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"- Adjust chunk size limit for this warning via build.chunkSizeWarningLimit.\u001b[39m\n\u001b[32m✓ built in 2.52s\u001b[39m\nconst list = await (await fetch(`http://127.0.0.1:${process.argv[2]}/json/list`)).json();\nconst ws = new WebSocket(list.find((t: any) => t.type === \"page\" && t.url.startsWith(\"app://\")).webSocketDebuggerUrl);\nawait new Promise((r) => ws.addEventListener(\"open\", r, { once: true }));\nws.send(JSON.stringify({ id: 1, method: \"Page.reload\", params: { ignoreCache: true } })); await Bun.sleep(3000); ws.close();","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"staleReadFileStateHint":"[This command modified 1 file you've previously read: src\\components\\AddMenu\\AddMenu.tsx. Call Read before editing.]","bashEditDiff":{"files":[{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304\\.claude\\skills\\verify-inkling\\features\\capture-note.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":1,"oldLines":34,"newStart":1,"newLines":34,"lines":["-# Capture a note from the Add menu\r","-\r","-## Sub-features\r","-\r","-- Note tile in the Add menu.\r","-- Save to library button; the card appears before any processing finishes.\r","-\r","-## How to get to it (user POV)\r","-\r","-Click Add at the foot of the sidebar. It opens into a menu of Note, Link, Quote, File, and Screenshot. Choose Note, type a line, and press Enter or Save to library. The new card lands at the top of Everything.\r","-\r","-## Driving it with `scripts/drive.mjs`\r","-\r","-Save as `steps.json`, then run with a fresh evidence dir:\r","-\r","-```json\r","-[\r","-  {\"label\": \"open Add\", \"click\": \"button[data-tooltip='Add something to your library']\"},\r","-  {\"label\": \"choose Note\", \"clickText\": {\"selector\": \".add-menu-tile\", \"text\": \"Note\"}},\r","-  {\"label\": \"note field\", \"wait\": \"textarea[aria-label='New note']\"},\r","-  {\"label\": \"type note\", \"fill\": \"textarea[aria-label='New note']\", \"text\": \"verify-inkling probe note\"},\r","-  {\"label\": \"save\", \"click\": \"button.add-menu-save\"},\r","-  {\"label\": \"card shows\", \"expect\": \"[...document.querySelectorAll('article')].some(a => a.textContent.includes('verify-inkling probe note'))\", \"timeoutMs\": 10000},\r","-  {\"label\": \"shot\", \"shot\": \"note-saved.png\"}\r","-]\r","-```\r","-\r","-End state proof: the card with the text is in the grid, and `items` has one row with `kind = 'note'`, `body = 'verify-inkling probe note'`, `body_format = 'md'`, `archived = 0`. The title stays null for notes.\r","-\r","-## Gotchas\r","-\r","-- Note title is null; the text lives in `body`. Check `body`, not `title`.\r","-- The menu only appears on Add, which lives in the sidebar. Opening Add another way (the N shortcut) opens the sidebar too.\r","-- Link, File, Quote, and Screenshot are not driven by this map yet.\r","+# Capture a note from the Add menu","+","+## Sub-features","+","+- Note tile in the Add menu.","+- Save to library button; the card appears before any processing finishes.","+","+## How to get to it (user POV)","+","+Click Add at the foot of the sidebar. It opens into a menu of Note, Link, Quote, File, and Screen (screenshot). Choose Note, type a line, and press Enter or Save to library. The new card lands at the top of Everything.","+","+## Driving it with `scripts/drive.mjs`","+","+Save as `steps.json`, then run with a fresh evidence dir:","+","+```json","+[","+  {\"label\": \"open Add\", \"click\": \"button[data-tooltip='Add something to your library']\"},","+  {\"label\": \"choose Note\", \"clickText\": {\"selector\": \".add-menu-tile\", \"text\": \"Note\"}},","+  {\"label\": \"note field\", \"wait\": \"textarea[aria-label='New note']\"},","+  {\"label\": \"type note\", \"fill\": \"textarea[aria-label='New note']\", \"text\": \"verify-inkling probe note\"},","+  {\"label\": \"save\", \"click\": \"button.add-menu-save\"},","+  {\"label\": \"card shows\", \"expect\": \"[...document.querySelectorAll('article')].some(a => a.textContent.includes('verify-inkling probe note'))\", \"timeoutMs\": 10000},","+  {\"label\": \"shot\", \"shot\": \"note-saved.png\"}","+]","+```","+","+End state proof: the card with the text is in the grid, and `items` has one row with `kind = 'note'`, `body = 'verify-inkling probe note'`, `body_format = 'md'`, `archived = 0`. The title stays null for notes.","+","+## Gotchas","+","+- Note title is null; the text lives in `body`. Check `body`, not `title`.","+- The menu only appears on Add, which lives in the sidebar. Opening Add another way (the N shortcut) opens the sidebar too.","+- Link, File, Quote, and Screenshot are not driven by this map yet."]}]},{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304\\src\\components\\AddMenu\\AddMenu.tsx","hunks":[{"oldStart":266,"oldLines":7,"newStart":266,"newLines":9,"lines":["   onSelect: () => void;"," }) {","   return (","-    <button type=\"button\" className=\"add-menu