{"parentUuid":"c7e5caa8-860f-4791-a9fa-4611750daba1","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgG7N9omYdypFH28SfvZi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_017dPAaSBu7tNVfouG8cT7m8","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd C:/Users/chris/.t3/worktrees/inkling/t3-47ff5304; grep -n \"^### \" docs/changelog.md | head -6; sed -n '70,78p' docs/changelog.md","description":"Locate section headers"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":261,"cache_read_input_tokens":73669,"output_tokens":144,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":261,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":144,"cache_read_input_tokens":73669,"cache_creation_input_tokens":261,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":261},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_017dPAaSBu7tNVfouG8cT7m8":{"command":"cd C:/Users/chris/.t3/worktrees/inkling/t3-47ff5304; grep -n \"^### \" docs/changelog.md | head -6; sed -n '70,78p' docs/changelog.md","description":"Locate section headers"}},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgG7N9WtqXASCHHAorxBy","requestRef":"aaac87c4-5abc-4d7d-a2de-87964586cb4e","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"8e6d8aef-4e41-4049-9a8d-c5723015a98b","timestamp":"2026-10-21T21:42:16.758Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
{"parentUuid":"8e6d8aef-4e41-4049-9a8d-c5723015a98b","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"d217de97-c69e-4ffb-8cab-90ef6199535a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017dPAaSBu7tNVfouG8cT7m8","type":"tool_result","content":"29:### Added\n75:### Fixed\n84:### Changed\n120:### Removed\n127:### Fixed\n166:### Added\n- Regular Spaces: manual collections alongside saved searches. The Space create form chooses Smart or Regular, a Regular Space holds only the items you file into it from the expanded item view, and the chips there show current membership and take an item back out. Deleting a Space still leaves its items alone (SQU-4, `src-tauri/src/storage.rs`, `src/App.tsx`, `src/components/ExpandedItemOverlay.tsx`)\n- Top of Mind: items can be pinned and unpinned from their details view, and the Top of mind view collects them. That view explains itself when nothing is pinned yet, and the main library stays a plain list of everything (SQU-9) (`src/App.tsx`, `src/components/ExpandedItemOverlay.tsx`)\n- The item count above the library rolls up when it first appears and replays when hovered, using the React Bits CountUp in compact format (`src/components/CountUp.tsx`, `src/components/AnimatedCount.tsx`)\n- Liquid glass in the desktop app: the library toolbar, search chip and image zoom control refract what is behind them through WebGPU and Chromium's HTML-in-Canvas, and fall back to the CSS glass when either is unavailable (#170)\n\n### Fixed\n\n- An open item takes over the whole library frame instead of floating inside it, so the sidebar tab, grid/list toggle and the selected card no longer show around its edges, and its actions line up with the bottom of the stage (#170)\n- List view thumbnails fill rows that grow taller than the artwork, instead of leaving a strip at the bottom (#170)","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"d45e4827-88d3-4e06-84cf-49ffcf44209e","timestamp":"2026-10-21T21:42:17.030Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"29:### Added\n75:### Fixed\n84:### Changed\n120:### Removed\n127:### Fixed\n166:### Added\n- Regular Spaces: manual collections alongside saved searches. The Space create form chooses Smart or Regular, a Regular Space holds only the items you file into it from the expanded item view, and the chips there show current membership and take an item back out. Deleting a Space still leaves its items alone (SQU-4, `src-tauri/src/storage.rs`, `src/App.tsx`, `src/components/ExpandedItemOverlay.tsx`)\n- Top of Mind: items can be pinned and unpinned from their details view, and the Top of mind view collects them. That view explains itself when nothing is pinned yet, and the main library stays a plain list of everything (SQU-9) (`src/App.tsx`, `src/components/ExpandedItemOverlay.tsx`)\n- The item count above the library rolls up when it first appears and replays when hovered, using the React Bits CountUp in compact format (`src/components/CountUp.tsx`, `src/components/AnimatedCount.tsx`)\n- Liquid glass in the desktop app: the library toolbar, search chip and image zoom control refract what is behind them through WebGPU and Chromium's HTML-in-Canvas, and fall back to the CSS glass when either is unavailable (#170)\n\n### Fixed\n\n- An open item takes over the whole library frame instead of floating inside it, so the sidebar tab, grid/list toggle and the selected card no longer show around its edges, and its actions line up with the bottom of the stage (#170)\n- List view thumbnails fill rows that grow taller than the artwork, instead of leaving a strip at the bottom (#170)","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"8e6d8aef-4e41-4049-9a8d-c5723015a98b","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
