{"parentUuid":"a1a3fd45-a681-4b4b-ab94-63244819e3be","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgG7PaLuyCwn59o1E9kNj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The push went through without issues, so now I can put together a final summary with screenshots.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":960,"cache_read_input_tokens":75667,"output_tokens":777,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":22},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":960,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":777,"cache_read_input_tokens":75667,"cache_creation_input_tokens":960,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":960},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":6926,"thinkingDisplay":"summarized","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgG7Pa3pCktLsyYqC2ixm","requestRef":"bed384eb-21be-421b-8acb-e974b665c29f","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"0e80c228-dd63-4e42-aeb2-00cb8f089d06","timestamp":"2026-10-21T21:42:42.169Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
{"parentUuid":"0e80c228-dd63-4e42-aeb2-00cb8f089d06","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgG7PaLuyCwn59o1E9kNj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All three changes are done, and I committed and pushed them to #170 as `e04e8ae` (nothing went to #174).\n\n**Add button.** The extra round + button in the library toolbar is gone. Pressing **N** while the sidebar is closed now opens the sidebar straight to the Note form.\n\n**Add menu.** I rebuilt Viora UI's Create New Disclosure and styled it for inkling. The sidebar's Add button now grows in place into a small panel with five tiles: Note, Link, Quote, File and Screen. I fixed four of their bugs:\n- **Tiles do nothing:** each tile now starts its capture.\n- **No way to close:** Escape steps back from a form, then closes the menu, and clicking outside closes it.\n- **Focus gets lost:** opening puts focus on the first tile, and closing puts it back on Add.\n- **Content stretches mid-animation:** the contents now fade in once the panel has mostly grown.\n\nTheir MIT license sits beside the component in `src/components/AddMenu/LICENSE.md`, and the menu is credited in Settings → Open source licenses. The Screenshot tile is labelled \"Screen\" because the full word got cut off; screen readers still hear \"Screenshot\".\n\n![Add menu open](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\addmenu\\open.png)\n![Note form](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\addmenu\\note.png)\n\n**List view whitespace.** A row's height now comes from its text, not the photo. Rows went from about 230px to 146px, and a note with a longer description is 167px. Short descriptions no longer reserve two lines of blank space either.\n\n![List view](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\addmenu\\list-after.png)\n\nI tested it in the desktop app against a scratch library: saving a note puts it at the top of the library, and Escape, outside-click and N all behave as described. I didn't try the File, Link or Screen tiles or saving a quote in the app. Typecheck, Biome, knip and the license tests pass. I added changelog lines for the new menu and the list fix, and updated the UI smoke script and the `verify-inkling` skill notes to the new menu."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":960,"cache_read_input_tokens":75667,"output_tokens":777,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":22},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":960,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":777,"cache_read_input_tokens":75667,"cache_creation_input_tokens":960,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":960},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgG7Pa3pCktLsyYqC2ixm","requestRef":"bed384eb-21be-421b-8acb-e974b665c29f","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"526a6964-ebf2-40ae-8be1-7262fc81a263","timestamp":"2026-10-21T21:42:42.305Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
