x;margin-top:-13px;border-radius:2px;background:#4a453f}\n.D .open .grip{left:80px}.D .closed .grip{left:4px}\n.D .hint{position:absolute;top:50%;margin-top:-9px;width:18px;height:18px;border-radius:50%;background:#26231f;border:1px solid var(--b)}\n.D .open .hint{left:89px}\n/* E rail */\n.E .closed .side{display:block;width:30px;padding:12px 7px}.E .closed .frame{left:30px}\n.E .closed .brand span,.E .closed .nav i{width:100%}\n.E .closed .brand span{display:none}\n.E .closed .nav i{height:9px;border-radius:3px}\n.E .foot{position:absolute;bottom:8px;left:8px;width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:4px;background:#201e1b}\n.rec{font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:var(--accent);margin-left:6px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em}\nsvg{width:9px;height:9px;stroke:var(--m);fill:none;stroke-width:2}\n</style></head><body>\n\n<div class=\"opt A\"><h3>A · Edge tab (today)</h3><p>A tab clipped to the frame's edge that flips sides. It moves when the sidebar does, and it covers content when the sidebar is closed.</p>\n<div class=\"pair\">\n<div class=\"win open\"><div class=\"side\"><div class=\"brand\"><div class=\"blob\"></div><span>inkling</span></div><div class=\"nav\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div><div class=\"frame\"><div class=\"grid\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div><div class=\"tab ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\"><path d=\"M6 2 3 5l3 3\"/></svg></div><span class=\"ctl\">– ▢ ✕</span><span class=\"lab\">open</span></div>\n<div class=\"win closed\"><div class=\"side\"></div><div class=\"frame\"><div class=\"grid\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div><div class=\"tab ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\"><path d=\"M4 2l3 3-3 3\"/></svg></div><span class=\"ctl\">– ▢ ✕</span><span class=\"lab\">closed</span></div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"opt C\"><h3>B · Fixed titlebar button <span class=\"rec\">Recommended</span></h3><p>One sidebar icon at the top left of the window band, in the same spot whether the sidebar is open or closed, like Arc or Edge. Nothing hangs off the frame or moves, and it never overlaps an open item.</p>\n<div class=\"pair\">\n<div class=\"win open\"><div class=\"side\"><div class=\"brand\"><div class=\"blob\"></div><span>inkling</span></div><div class=\"nav\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div><div class=\"frame\"><div class=\"grid\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div><div class=\"btn ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1.5\" width=\"8\" height=\"7\" rx=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M4 1.5v7\"/></svg></div><span class=\"ctl\">– ▢ ✕</span><span class=\"lab\">open</span></div>\n<div class=\"win closed\"><div class=\"side\"></div><div class=\"frame\"><div class=\"grid\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div><div class=\"btn ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1.5\" width=\"8\" height=\"7\" rx=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M4 1.5v7\"/></svg></div><span class=\"ctl\">– ▢ ✕</span><span class=\"lab\">closed</span></div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"opt B\"><h3>C · In the sidebar header</h3><p>A quiet icon beside the inkling wordmark, shown on hover, like Notion or Linear. When the sidebar is closed it reappears at the top left of the frame, in the toolbar row.</p>\n<div class=\"pair\">\n<div class=\"win open\"><div class=\"side\"><div class=\"brand\"><div class=\"blob\"></div><span>inkling</span></div><div class=\"nav\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div><div class=\"frame\"><div class=\"grid\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div><div class=\"btn ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\"><path d=\"M6 2 3 5l3 3\"/><path d=\"M8 2 5 5l3 3\"/></svg></div><span class=\"ctl\">– ▢ ✕</span><span class=\"lab\">open</span></div>\n<div class=\"win closed\"><div class=\"side\"></div><div class=\"frame\"><div class=\"grid\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div><div class=\"btn ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1.5\" width=\"8\" height=\"7\" rx=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M4 1.5v7\"/></svg></div><span class=\"ctl\">– ▢ ✕</span><span class=\"lab\">closed</span></div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"opt D\"><h3>D · Edge grip</h3><p>No button at rest. Hovering the frame's left edge shows a short grip and a small round arrow, like VS Code's sash or Arc's edge. It's the cleanest look but the hardest to find, so it needs the keyboard shortcut to carry it.</p>\n<div class=\"pair\">\n<div class=\"win open\"><div class=\"side\"><div class=\"brand\"><div class=\"blob\"></div><span>inkling</span></div><div class=\"nav\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div><div class=\"frame\"><div class=\"grid\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div><div class=\"grip\"></div><div class=\"hint ico\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\"><path d=\"M6 2 3 5l3 3\"/></svg></div><span class=\"ctl\">– ▢ ✕</span><span class=\"lab\">open, on hover</span></div>\n<div class=\"win closed\"><div class=\"side\"></div><div class=\"frame\"><div class=\"grid\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div><div class=\"grip\"></div><span class=\"ctl\">– ▢ ✕</span><span class=\"lab\">closed, at rest</span></div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"opt E\"><h3>E · Collapse to a rail</h3><p>Closing leaves a thin icon rail instead of hiding the sidebar, with the toggle at its foot by Settings. Views and Spaces stay one click away, but it's a bigger change than restyling one button.</p>\n<div class=\"pair\">\n<div class=\"win open\"><div class=\"side\"><div class=\"brand\"><div class=\"blob\"></div><span>inkling</span></div><div class=\"nav\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class=\"foot\"></div></div><div class=\"frame\"><div class=\"grid\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div><span class=\"ctl\">– ▢ ✕</span><span class=\"lab\">open</span></div>\n<div class=\"win closed\"><div class=\"side\"><div class=\"brand\"><div class=\"blob\"></div><span>inkling</span></div><div class=\"nav\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class=\"foot\"></div></div><div class=\"frame\"><div class=\"grid\"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></div><span class=\"ctl\">– ▢ ✕</span><span class=\"lab\">closed</span></div>\n</div></div>\n</body></html>"}},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgGA5kdu51xigsFTyBByD","requestRef":"86ea9d03-06de-4de0-86e8-e65ab0cc0e18","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"5046204f-d29e-4873-9da3-667541f40b59","timestamp":"2026-10-21T22:18:26.387Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
