{"parentUuid":"b1f8b4cc-595f-4517-899f-be073d5d492c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGAADuM1ABoVePkdJ32x","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I should give a brief recommendation and be upfront that this isn't built yet. I'm also uncertain whether a keyboard shortcut already exists for this, so I shouldn't claim one does — but it's worth noting that this change would let us remove the flip animation code and the special-case handling for item view.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4161,"cache_read_input_tokens":129009,"output_tokens":374,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":76},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4161,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":374,"cache_read_input_tokens":129009,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4161,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4161},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":4013,"thinkingDisplay":"summarized","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGAADXG9dfD9DEGx7Kup","requestRef":"b8be2c76-d2f9-4236-8de4-2c9af39fa62f","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"t3-code","attributionMcpTool":"html_render","type":"assistant","uuid":"86a3a223-2c25-4a27-9190-7297ec93f585","timestamp":"2026-10-21T22:18:58.798Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
{"parentUuid":"86a3a223-2c25-4a27-9190-7297ec93f585","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGAADuM1ABoVePkdJ32x","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'd go with **B**, a fixed button in the titlebar.\n\n- **It solves the problem we just patched.** The button lives in the window's title band, which the item view already leaves empty. So it doesn't need hiding while an item is open, and there's still a way to open the sidebar from there.\n- **It's less code.** The flip animation, the solid tab styling, and the special case for hiding it over an item all go away. What's left is one ordinary icon button with a tooltip.\n- **It never moves.** You learn its spot once. The current tab jumps about 230px every time the sidebar opens or closes.\n\nIf you'd rather keep the title band clear, **C** is my second choice. It's a cleaner fit for the sidebar header, but it needs two buttons, one in the header and one for when the sidebar is closed.\n\nI haven't changed anything yet. Tell me which one you want and I'll build it, test it in the app, and push it to #170."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4161,"cache_read_input_tokens":129009,"output_tokens":374,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":76},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4161,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":374,"cache_read_input_tokens":129009,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4161,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4161},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgGAADXG9dfD9DEGx7Kup","requestRef":"b8be2c7