{"parentUuid":"e0143ad4-0614-4503-8812-c822dae62292","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGBappadhSDKEsJT4ih1","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'm thinking through two UI details: where the sidebar header icon should sit when the panel is open versus collapsed, and adjusting the default vertical position of the library content so it aligns closer to the blue reference line near the top of the window rather than its current lower position.\n\nThat makes sense since the LiquidGlass component is already used in the capture bar and view dock. For the higher-fidelity mockup, I think I'll build an HTML mock using real screenshots of the app as backgrounds, overlaying the grip and hint elements at precise positions, and maybe make it interactive with hover states. I'll start by reviewing the capture bar code, library grid padding, LiquidGlass usage, edge tab, and brand header.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2094,"cache_read_input_tokens":133170,"output_tokens":990,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":779},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2094,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":990,"cache_read_input_tokens":133170,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2094,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2094},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":11092,"thinkingDisplay":"summarized","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGBakTf7pypNYWYszEtL","requestRef":"0e006272-10ac-4d87-965a-ff95b5c1c9fa","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":