{"parentUuid":"d3102fbf-8618-4f6f-aede-b0a86b2874d0","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGBv2aHrEvkzwqYWcVCc","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Interesting that reload works fine with st=52 — so the failure is specific to cold/first launch, not reload itself. Maybe the script isn't injecting in time, or the window isn't visible/focused on cold start so rAF gets throttled, even though apply() itself runs synchronously first.\n\nPerhaps on first launch the grid isn't scrollable yet because Virtuoso hasn't rendered, so the scrollTop attempt clamps to 0, and the retry loop runs out of attempts before Virtuoso actually lays out. A more robust fix would be to use a ResizeObserver on the grid's content container instead of fixed rAF retries, applying the scroll offset whenever layout changes until the user manually scrolls or interacts, then stopping.\n\nWriting ResizeObserver hook...\n\nActually, I suspect the timing issue is tied to when items load async—if filteredItems is empty initially, restScrollKey could be empty and the effect bails before the grid exists. Rather than keep reasoning abstractly, I should just relaunch the app fresh and observe the actual behavior at startup.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":285,"cache_read_input_tokens":171585,"output_tokens":1547,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1051},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":285,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1547,"cache_read_input_tokens":171585,"cache_creation_input_tokens":285,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":285},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":13469,"thinkingDisplay":"summarized","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGBv2HBWXcNSvcEz1eKr","requestRef":"e3b1056a-e6a5-479c-be26-57b3b4f27c95","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"868f6244-6e68-4bae-84dd-9ed1317d4b3b","timestamp":"2026-10-21T22:42:09.332Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
