{"type":"pr-link","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","prNumber":170,"prUrl":"https://github.com/Squidys-Tools/inkling/pull/170","prRepository":"Squidys-Tools/inkling","timestamp":"2026-10-21T22:46:51.199Z"}
{"parentUuid":"7e302d05-f583-4d6c-a9f4-2abce3b135ab","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGCHrfbhXYXfqk2x9cZG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'm designing the grip control for the collapsible frame edge: a 10px hit zone along the border, with a hover state showing a rounded pill plus a small glass circle with a chevron icon positioned just inside the frame.\n\nFor the closed state, the pill sits near the edge at low opacity, brightening on hover with the chevron pointing right and a \"Open sidebar\" tooltip. I'm planning an interactive demo stage that crossfades between open/closed screenshots on click with a matching 0.3s transition, plus static detail crops zoomed into the edge region, scaled dynamically via JS since the images are 1280x720 and need to fit a responsive container.\n\nFor the zoomed detail view, I'll build a reusable Scene component that scales and positions the same screenshot at a higher zoom factor. I also need to account for the image paths being local Windows file paths, so I'll try formatting them as \"C:/...\" and fall back to \"/C:/...\" if that doesn't resolve.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1324,"cache_read_input_tokens":201105,"output_tokens":3948,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":712},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1324,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":3948,"cache_read_input_tokens":201105,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1324,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1324},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinki