{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","id":"990c2e76-3ca9-444f-bb9f-bea65bb14aee","timestamp":"2026-10-21T22:49:20.585Z","version":"2.1.306","querySource":"sdk","shapeHash":"4325e2b9fcbda78c081d69a7cdc424779de8471fd78a037fce4545e52da59e6e","params":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"summarized"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"medium"}},"base":"fff6c095-5447-4917-a9c7-b97440c88f60","keep":434,"tail":["230562c10bc07029aef838ec29aac1c126b98379094878ed6ec371ce2294fc26","2f1b65985c47b729a52445aac1c722f5dc5d4f859e16b3c8c2e2e18e1588cbac","71e4fb48294089891b9ab485ea0a1d4eb0e6207c5880eb8daeec7f224ab668ae"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",436,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"e5dbe3f61079dbbfc29a573b502db827489c418335ec703b116d33cae5e44652"}
{"type":"pr-link","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","prNumber":170,"prUrl":"https://github.com/Squidys-Tools/inkling/pull/170","prRepository":"Squidys-Tools/inkling","timestamp":"2026-10-21T22:49:21.282Z"}
{"parentUuid":"f1582346-bfa6-4f4a-9c96-8c388b855430","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGCUsUXSyT9p7vxxWp4t","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I built option C, fixed the library's resting height and moved the right-click menu to liquid glass. It's committed and pushed to #170 (`4c6669a`). Option D is only the mockup above; I haven't built it.\n\n**Sidebar buttons (C).** The tab on the frame's edge is gone.\n- **Open sidebar:** a close button sits beside the inkling wordmark and shows while the pointer is over the sidebar.\n- **Closed sidebar:** a round open button sits at the left end of the toolbar, level with the search chip. It's drawn in liquid glass over the cards.\n- **Keyboard:** pressing one button moves focus to the other.\n\n![Sidebar closed](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\sidebar\\closed.png)\n\n**Library height.** The first row now rests at the top of the frame, right on your blue line. The app was already meant to start there but wasn't, for two reasons:\n- **Liquid glass reset the scroll.** When liquid glass starts, it moves the whole library into its canvas, and the move threw the scroll back to the top. Liquid glass now keeps scroll positions through that move, in both directions.\n- **The window starts hidden at launch.** The old code retried for 10 frames and gave up while the window was still hidden. Now it re-applies the position whenever the grid lays out, and stops as soon as you scroll, click or type.\n\nOn a cold launch the first card now sits at y=37 with liquid glass running.\n\n![Library at rest](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\sidebar\\rest.png)\n\n**Right-click menu.** It's now drawn in liquid glass too. It can only open over library cards, so there's always library behind it to refract.\n\n![Card menu](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\sidebar\\ctxmenu.png)\n\nI tested all of this in the desktop app against a scratch library. Typecheck, Biome and knip pass, and the changelog is updated. I put the `inkling://` link handler in the registry back as it was.\n\n**About D:** the `Ctrl+\\` shortcut in the mockup doesn't exist yet. If you pick D, I'd add that shortcut with it, because nothing shows at rest when the sidebar is open."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":667,"cache_read_input_tokens":222637,"output_tokens":765,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":667,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":765,"cache_read_input_tokens":222637,"cache_creation_input_tokens":667,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":667},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGCUrx2DJm1VDfNF1R7p","requestRef":"990c2e76-3ca9-444f-bb9f-bea65bb14aee","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"6369722c-fd5c-4ac2-9aa8-79e2b684ff6d","timestamp":"2026-10-21T22:49:27.989Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
