{"parentUuid":"712aa5e4-ce66-4ed6-b105-662bc9383714","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGEJsCc1mt6USrGNTWMt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'm adding a sidebarToggle option with \"Buttons\" and \"Edge grip\" choices to the appearance settings, updating the loader to pick it up generically. I also want to add the Ctrl+\\ shortcut globally and need to find the shortcuts modal list to register the new entry there.\n\nNow I'm sketching the SidebarEdgeGrip component: a button fixed to the frame's left edge whose position shifts between the collapsed and expanded sidebar states, visible only on desktop and hidden appropriately when an item is open. Writing component structure...\n\nI'm deciding how to attach the tooltip — placing the data-tooltip attribute on the inner knob span rather than the full-height button, since TooltipLayer picks up hover via closest match, and settling on text like \"Close sidebar · Ctrl+\\\\\". For the knob's visual treatment I'll use plain CSS glass with a backdrop-filter rather than the liquid-glass system since this control sits outside the main target roots, then I'm working out the clickable hit area dimensions and vertical offset below the titlebar for both open and closed states.\n\nI'm setting pointer-events to none on the knob except when hovered or focus-visible, so the invisible knob area over the library cards doesn't steal hover, and confirming the hit zones don't actually conflict with card padding when the sidebar is open. Then I'm thinking through hiding the edge grip below the mobile breakpoint and what has to replace it there.\n\nOn mobile, buttons should always show; on desktop I want a `sidebar-edge` class on the app shell to conditionally render the grip versus the regular toggle/close buttons, with CSS scoped to desktop viewport hiding the standard buttons in edge mode. I'm also checking that the focus-handoff effect correctly skips when the grip itself holds focus, confirming the chevron icon import and rotation for the closed state, and noting I still need to wire up the Ctrl+\\ shortcut via a global keydown listener.\n\n","signature":""}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1878,"cache_read_input_tokens":224829,"output_tokens":1920,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":1588},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1878,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1920,"cache_read_input_tokens":224829,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1878,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1878},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"thinkingDurationMs":20299,"thinkingDisplay":"summarized","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGEJrvFNe9ccwKEgoX8f","requestRef":"40d78e85-5103-4517-a8f7-194fdaeeadf4","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"ae3d9e83-0643-43b2-81a9-8d8c5fe57357","timestamp":"2026-10-21T23:13:39.700Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
