47ff5304\\docs\\changelog.md","hunks":[{"oldStart":31,"oldLines":7,"newStart":31,"newLines":8,"lines":[" - Right-click a card to read, favorite, open its link, copy its link, show it in its folder, or archive it, from a menu in the library's glass (#170)"," - Buttons show a short label on hover or keyboard focus, in the same glass as the controls around them (#170)"," - Settings → General → Open source licenses lists every shipped dependency, vendored component, and bundled model with its license text and source, searchable and filterable by license (#170)","-- Settings → Appearance switches components between alternative looks while we compare them, starting with the grid/list toggle as the current pill or a coss ui segmented control (#170)","+- Settings → Appearance switches components between alternative looks while we compare them, the grid/list toggle as the current pill or a coss ui segmented control, and the sidebar button as buttons in the sidebar header and toolbar or a grip on the library frame's edge (#170)","+- Ctrl+\\ (⌘+\\ on a Mac) shows or hides the sidebar (#170)"," - First-run welcome flow on first launch of the installed app, replayable from Settings → General"," - PDF cards now show page-one thumbnails generated in the background after capture; existing PDFs are backfilled one at a time when the job queue is idle."," - Chrome MV3 extension saves a page or right-clicked link through inkling's local capture receiver, with the existing capture link as fallback."]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304\\docs\\changelog.md"]}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"cdec614a-3432-4ad3-81a6-2e5c03c076a5","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munchin