{"type":"pr-link","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","prNumber":170,"prUrl":"https://github.com/Squidys-Tools/inkling/pull/170","prRepository":"Squidys-Tools/inkling","timestamp":"2026-10-21T23:16:55.877Z"}
{"parentUuid":"7d4bcb3b-307d-411f-afe1-0f3544b0e42d","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGEarbLyrvKQA4c1SWoD","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Settings → Appearance now has a **Sidebar button** choice, so you can compare C and D. I committed and pushed it to #170 as `1f58397`.\n\n- **Buttons (default):** option C, the close button by the wordmark and the glass open button in the toolbar.\n- **Edge grip:** option D, built as in the mockup.\n  - **Sidebar open:** nothing shows at rest. Hovering the frame's left edge brings up a grip and a round glass knob.\n  - **Sidebar closed:** a faint grip stays on the window's edge so you can get back.\n  - **Clicking:** anywhere along the edge toggles the sidebar.\n  - **With an item open:** the grip hides while the sidebar is closed, the same rule the old tab had.\n\nThe choice is saved and switches straight away, without a restart.\n\n![Settings, Appearance](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\sidebar\\settings.png)\n![Edge grip, sidebar open, hovered](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\sidebar\\grip-open-hover.png)\n![Edge grip, sidebar closed, hovered](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\sidebar\\grip-closed-hover.png)\n\nI also added **Ctrl+\\\\** (⌘+\\\\ on a Mac) to show or hide the sidebar. It works in both modes and is listed in the shortcuts sheet.\n\nDifferences from the mockup:\n- **Tooltip:** it only appears when the pointer reaches the knob, and it sits below the knob rather than beside it, because the app's tooltips always anchor under the control. Hovering the bare edge brings up the grip and knob but no tooltip.\n- **Knob glass:** the knob uses the plain CSS glass, not liquid glass, because liquid glass only draws under controls inside the library, and the grip sits outside it.\n- **Narrow windows:** the edge grip only exists in the desktop layout, so narrow windows always use the buttons.\n\nI tested both modes in the desktop app: hover, toggling from the edge, the shortcut both ways, and switching modes live. The shortcut tests, typecheck, Biome and knip pass, and the changelog is updated. When you've picked one, I'll delete the other and remove the setting."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1044,"cache_read_input_tokens":252846,"output_tokens":785,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1044,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":785,"cache_read_input_tokens":252846,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1044,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1044},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgGEarHVX4e3VWuYjsUMv","requestRef":"cdb7b02c-281d-4686-a20d-54d5a186da15","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"3023440e-d679-4dd4-95dd-6955291fb9e5","timestamp":"2026-10-21T23:17:02.593Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
