{"type":"pr-link","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","prNumber":170,"prUrl":"https://github.com/Squidys-Tools/inkling/pull/170","prRepository":"Squidys-Tools/inkling","timestamp":"2026-10-21T23:26:44.485Z"}
{"parentUuid":"8a1b18fb-deaf-4976-b8af-bea4dda8c5e3","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgGFLF3ucTUrDS5veRaCZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The library no longer scrolls past its top. The cards rest just under the window controls, with the search chip floating over them. I pushed it to #170 as `56a2639`.\n\nThe extra scroll came from a 52px gap above the first row. The library was meant to open scrolled past it, but scrolling up still pulled the cards down into it. I removed the gap, along with the startup code that held the scroll past it.\n\nI checked it in the desktop app: with the scroll at the top, the first card sits at y=37 (your line), and scrolling up doesn't move it, in grid or list view.\n\n![Library at the top](C:\\Users\\chris\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\agents\\chat-images\\sidebar\\top.png)\n\nI kept the earlier fix that carries scroll positions through liquid glass starting up, so a library you've already scrolled doesn't jump back to the top when it kicks in.\n\nSerendipity also loses that gap, since it uses the same grid; before, it was the one view that kept the gap at rest.\n\nTypecheck and Biome pass, and I updated the changelog line."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1008,"cache_read_input_tokens":262557,"output_tokens":344,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1008,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":344,"cache_read_input_tokens":262557,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1008,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1008},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null