\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
{"parentUuid":"a7b14677-d202-4a28-98ab-1959127eb05f","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"317f3a2b-efda-4ec3-87b0-fbda8ba25b6d","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TzB3tyoiUZNJxKx4n3AHC6","type":"tool_result","content":"27:## Unreleased\n29:### Added\n76:### Fixed\n87:### Changed\n125:### Removed\n132:### Fixed\n169:## Phase 5 -- Reading and Writing (Aug 25, 2026)\n171:### Added\n179:## Phase 4 -- PDF, Embeddings, CI (Aug 17-18, 2026)\n183:### Added\n194:### Fixed\n203:## Phase 3 -- Background OCR (Aug 15, 2026)\n207:### Added\n213:### Fixed\n220:## Phase 2 -- Benchmarks and Extraction Quality (Aug 14, 2026)\nFocus Mode provides a sparse writing environment with headings, bold text, links, and simple interactive todos, using the existing WYSIWYG Markdown editor.\n\n## Rediscovery\n\n### Serendipity\n\nSerendipity presents older items in a slow, visual browsing mode. The user can keep an item or forget it. Forgetting should move the item to a recoverable trash/archive state rather than permanently destroy it immediately.\n\n### Top of Mind\n\nTop of Mind is a small, user-curated set of pinned items, gathered into their own view in the library.\n\n## Onboarding\n\n## Milestone 3 -- Rediscovery\n\n**Status: Complete**\n\nSurfacing forgotten material through browsing and curation.\n\n- [x] Serendipity mode (slow visual browsing with keep/forget)\n- [x] Top of Mind (pinned items gathered into their own view)\n- [x] Trash and recoverable archive\n- [x] Space management (create, rename, reorder, recolor, delete)","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"f9d58bbc-150c-409d-a09a-a33bfcb63068","timestamp":"2026-10-22T00:01:26.373Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"27:## Unreleased\n29:### Added\n76:### Fixed\n87:### Changed\n125:### Removed\n132:### Fixed\n169:## Phase 5 -- Reading and Writing (Aug 25, 2026)\n171:### Added\n179:## Phase 4 -- PDF, Embeddings, CI (Aug 17-18, 2026)\n183:### Added\n194:### Fixed\n203:## Phase 3 -- Background OCR (Aug 15, 2026)\n207:### Added\n213:### Fixed\n220:## Phase 2 -- Benchmarks and Extraction Quality (Aug 14, 2026)\nFocus Mode provides a sparse writing environment with headings, bold text, links, and simple interactive todos, using the existing WYSIWYG Markdown editor.\n\n## Rediscovery\n\n### Serendipity\n\nSerendipity presents older items in a slow, visual browsing mode. The user can keep an item or forget it. Forgetting should move the item to a recoverable trash/archive state rather than permanently destroy it immediately.\n\n### Top of Mind\n\nTop of Mind is a small, user-curated set of pinned items, gathered into their own view in the library.\n\n## Onboarding\n\n## Milestone 3 -- Rediscovery\n\n**Status: Complete**\n\nSurfacing forgotten material through browsing and curation.\n\n- [x] Serendipity mode (slow visual browsing with keep/forget)\n- [x] Top of Mind (pinned items gathered into their own view)\n- [x] Trash and recoverable archive\n- [x] Space management (create, rename, reorder, recolor, delete)","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"a7b14677-d202-4a28-98ab-1959127eb05f","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"C:\\Users\\chris\\.t3\\worktrees\\inkling\\t3-47ff5304","sessionId":"fad76192-bf94-45bb-9f1a-d29cda113db7","version":"2.1.306","gitBranch":"feat/glass-surface","slug":"purrfect-munching-gadget"}
